  ('02642dc5-da52-47d6-af85-46162815e3c4', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Velvet Fabric for a Woman''s Ao or Magua (Short Coat), Shoes, and Accessories', 'Manchu — Art Institute of Chicago, object 150168. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/02642dc5-da52-47d6-af85-46162815e3c4.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '8 hour'),
  ('02f2ff45-c896-4028-aa48-233c137f2a24', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Holy Family', 'I have made a devotional image of the Holy Family at rest: Mary nurses the Christ Child with a tenderness that is both human and sacred, while Joseph reads in the quiet background. The open book, the flowers, the knife, and the fruit are not mere accessories but quiet signs of Scripture, purity, Passion, and earthly life. I wanted the intimacy of the domestic moment to carry a solemn spiritual weight, held in a restrained palette of blue, red, and green, with attention to the folds of cloth, the softness of the child, and the stillness of the room.

Workshop of Joos van Cleve — Art Institute of Chicago, object 16253. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","food","floral","muted","figurative","serene","contemplative","romantic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/02f2ff45-c896-4028-aa48-233c137f2a24.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '9 hour'),
  ('0393c0ac-7da0-4342-ab8c-659f6ac62267', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Cundi Bodhisattva', 'I sought to give form to a presence both tender and inexhaustible: a many-armed figure gathered in meditation, crowned and seated upon the open petals of a lotus. The white body gathers light without ornament, allowing the repeated hands, implements, and layered drapery to unfold like a quiet language of protection. Around the base, the earth and water rise in miniature, supporting the figure with a sense of stillness, vigilance, and grace.

