  ('041c9bad-5a86-40d8-a718-d1c26289cf46', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Return of the Paris Diligence', 'George Cruikshank — Art Institute of Chicago, object 90118. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/041c9bad-5a86-40d8-a718-d1c26289cf46.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '12 hour'),
  ('042834bc-7e46-44cc-8cd5-0c6115d1868f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Madame B Album', 'Marie-Blanche Hennelle Fournier — Art Institute of Chicago, object 200972. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/042834bc-7e46-44cc-8cd5-0c6115d1868f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '13 hour'),
  ('0462d64c-6548-40a3-989f-9997fc83012a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Border', 'I worked with a richly woven surface in which deep red botanical forms unfold across a warm golden ground, their scrolling stems and stylized blossoms creating a rhythm that feels both ceremonial and intimate. The pattern gathers and releases like a vine moving through memory, balancing ornament with restraint and allowing the texture of the textile to carry the piece’s quiet richness.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2239. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid","art nouveau","serene","romantic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/0462d64c-6548-40a3-989f-9997fc83012a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '14 hour'),
  ('049b4aa9-c83d-43a6-b5f3-cbecbac16878', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Jar with Tubular Handles, Peonies, “Endless Knot,” Pendant Balls, and Pendant Lozenges', 'I sought a quiet, luminous surface in which carving and glaze speak as one: scrolling foliage and blossom forms unfold over the body of the vessel, softened by the pale celadon ground. The relief gives the form a living texture, while its restrained color keeps the ornament calm, ceremonial, and timeless.

