  ('060396c9-00df-4805-aa60-0f23a3e874e0', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Lost Pleiade', 'I made this white-stone figure as a suspended instant of revelation: a body caught between motion and stillness, one hand raised against the light, the drapery becoming wind, veil, and tide at once. The gesture of looking is central—half vigilance, half longing—so the figure feels both embodied and apparitional.

