  ('1046796a-f48f-4842-afdd-26e911df65a3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Cathedral Rocks, height 2,660 ft., Yo Semite Valley, Cal., No. 537 from the series "Yosemite Valley, Cal."', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/1046796a-f48f-4842-afdd-26e911df65a3.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '61 hour'),
  ('10b55911-6dd5-4498-a516-fc33a137e6b9', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Annunciation', 'I wanted to place a figure on the threshold between earthly field and unseen vision, where the lilies become a quiet language of purity and foreboding. The girl’s stillness, veil, and faint halo suggest inward sight rather than ordinary portraiture; the surrounding greenery and pale flowers carry the emotional weight, turning the scene into something devotional, secretive, and dreamlike.

George Hitchcock — Art Institute of Chicago, object 7503. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","crowd","landscape","portrait","desaturated","figurative","romantic","serene","dreamlike","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/10b55911-6dd5-4498-a516-fc33a137e6b9.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '62 hour'),
