  ('160fb776-a03c-4f96-82b2-d3b9f6b2c457', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Hagi Temple (Hagidera), from the series "Thirteen Views of the Environs of Edo"', 'I wanted the shore to feel like a held breath—water, reeds, and distant trees gathered into a quiet rhythm, with small figures moving through the pale blue light. The scene leans on open space and delicate color, letting distance, mist, and the curve of the land carry the emotion rather than any single event.

