  ('192fe95c-cd68-4b6b-b126-5a9e826e9e0f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Marie de’ Medici', 'Frans Pourbus, the Younger — Art Institute of Chicago, object 78591. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","portrait","interior","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/192fe95c-cd68-4b6b-b126-5a9e826e9e0f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '99 hour'),
  ('19466fe6-aa7c-49a7-b676-056f0663d440', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fragment (Dress Fabric)', 'I set a warm, weathered ground beneath scrolling stems and clustered blossoms, letting the worn threads and softened color carry the sense of age. The pattern moves like a garden remembered rather than observed, with dark forms pressing into the cloth and pale highlights curling through the weave.

