  ('1a3b1397-6a6f-4fdd-bf9b-e35fc638b4f3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Interior', 'I sought a quiet room as a vessel of presence, letting the dim wall, old furniture, and small relics gather the weight of an absent life. The space is spare but charged, its worn surfaces and fragile light holding memory in a state both still and restless.

