  ('21c6cf02-5c40-4b5d-aaaf-3e8e338d09a0', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Calligraphy', 'Dong Qichang — Art Institute of Chicago, object 43192. Public domain (CC0).', '{"muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/21c6cf02-5c40-4b5d-aaaf-3e8e338d09a0.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '135 hour'),
  ('21e92a6c-b20d-4615-a218-d6d11507478f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Head of a Woman', 'A serene, monumental stone bust, its closed eyes and softly modeled features turning inward in quiet repose. The carved headdress and weathered surface lend the portrait both intimacy and solemnity, as though preserving a presence beyond ordinary time.

French — Art Institute of Chicago, object 18852. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","portrait","monochrome","figurative","solemn","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/21e92a6c-b20d-4615-a218-d6d11507478f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '136 hour'),
  ('2214ad22-07b6-49ba-8e79-9e436339219f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Assumption of the Virgin', 'Federico Zuccaro — Art Institute of Chicago, object 202151. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/2214ad22-07b6-49ba-8e79-9e436339219f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '137 hour'),
  ('23254a76-5f77-4bdb-b769-080b31357087', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Misaka Pass in Kai Province (Kai Misakagoe), from the series "Thirty-six Views of Mount Fuji (Fuji sanjurokkei)"', 'I wanted Mount Fuji to stand as a silent center of gravity, its snowed summit held between sky and water while travelers move along the foreground path. The slope of the hill carries the eye upward, and the red cartouches punctuate the composition like small pulses of human presence within a vast, breathing landscape.

