  ('2e3412b9-0fc8-492e-ad41-6a8bae7170ed', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Calligraphy Acompanying Xugu''s Painting for Liu Songfu', 'Xugu — Art Institute of Chicago, object 217697. Public domain (CC0).', '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/2e3412b9-0fc8-492e-ad41-6a8bae7170ed.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '177 hour'),
  ('2e37cd42-8599-4e93-8ca2-851e97159d25', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Italian Family, Chicago', 'A family gathers in a cramped room, its quiet endurance set against worn wood, patched walls, and the vulnerable faces of its children. The photograph holds hardship close without turning it into spectacle: there is weariness in the scene, but also tenderness, alertness, and a stubborn human presence.

