  ('2e6bb954-2de8-4a8f-9fd1-ec44dd024b90', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'West Virginia Coal Mine', 'I made this photograph to record the working conditions and character of the mine, with two men and their equipment framed by timber supports, rails, and the rough earth around them. The composition is direct and unadorned, emphasizing the material reality of labor, the heaviness of the setting, and the quiet presence of the workers within it.

Lewis Wickes Hine — Art Institute of Chicago, object 23226. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated","realism","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/2e6bb954-2de8-4a8f-9fd1-ec44dd024b90.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '182 hour'),
