  ('2fe63007-1be4-4af9-a950-1eef9bb676c4', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Short Beaker Depicting Ritual Figure wearing Costume with Bird Attributes', 'Nasca — Art Institute of Chicago, object 91175. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/2fe63007-1be4-4af9-a950-1eef9bb676c4.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '187 hour'),
  ('30059c90-9ecc-4de8-ae9e-cb9b1e1a0cc1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'John Van der Wall', 'Thomas Hudson — Art Institute of Chicago, object 60804. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","portrait","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/30059c90-9ecc-4de8-ae9e-cb9b1e1a0cc1.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '188 hour'),
  ('304034d8-92fc-47d6-8e16-0bde0de57bba', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Vessel with Feline Supernaturals with Striped Arms, likely Pampas Cats', 'Nasca — Art Institute of Chicago, object 91075. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","muted","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/304034d8-92fc-47d6-8e16-0bde0de57bba.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '189 hour'),
  ('30f1d5c6-8c43-439e-8a6f-b8416a7e8d71', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Nydia, The Blind Flower Girl of Pompeii', 'I sought to give sorrow a body without excess: a woman gathered inward, hand to brow, clothed in a veil and drapery that move as though thought itself had taken weight. The quiet discipline of the carved form is balanced by the softness of falling fabric, so that restraint becomes tenderness and mourning feels less like spectacle than a held breath.

Randolph Rogers — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2446. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","crowd","portrait","monochrome","figurative","melancholic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/30f1d5c6-8c43-439e-8a6f-b8416a7e8d71.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '190 hour'),
  ('3107bef1-a1d0-4a40-b55d-161d16bc0af4', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Beaker with Plants, Possibly Cacti, and Abstract Figures', 'Nasca — Art Institute of Chicago, object 91299. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3107bef1-a1d0-4a40-b55d-161d16bc0af4.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '191 hour'),
  ('31d83cde-525d-4c1f-8061-be137a0cc60b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Grapevines', 'Sakai Oho — Art Institute of Chicago, object 214280. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ink","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/31d83cde-525d-4c1f-8061-be137a0cc60b.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '192 hour'),
  ('3243058e-6a66-4c78-bf63-d6ab416978b1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Papal Medal of Julius II', 'Italian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 110130. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","botanical","portrait","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3243058e-6a66-4c78-bf63-d6ab416978b1.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '193 hour'),
  ('3280fe8c-d9f9-4d88-b2c3-8e7f9d39da91', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fragment (Band)', 'I think of this piece as a long, wandering seam—part cord, part body, part memory. The fibers twist and thicken as if pulled through time, carrying the marks of handling, pressure, and wear. Its earthy colors feel worn rather than decorated, and the small flashes of deeper red read almost like interruptions in an otherwise quiet line.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2083. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid","abstract","gestural","contemplative","melancholic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3280fe8c-d9f9-4d88-b2c3-8e7f9d39da91.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '194 hour'),
  ('32a64637-87ff-465e-87a7-fdff1b2074fd', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Daoist God Zhenwu (Perfected Warrior), Supreme Emperor of the Dark Heaven', 'Chen Yanqing — Art Institute of Chicago, object 71479. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/32a64637-87ff-465e-87a7-fdff1b2074fd.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '195 hour'),
  ('32ee412e-fd24-4f45-8d71-265a92951ac6', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'A Triple Portrait of Hermine, Emilia, and Helena', 'Emilie Mediz-Pelikan — Art Institute of Chicago, object 263364. Public domain (CC0).', '{"graphite","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/32ee412e-fd24-4f45-8d71-265a92951ac6.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '196 hour'),
  ('33ac9c96-5c3d-45f2-8824-e786832d8c75', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Statuette of the God Horus', 'Ancient Egyptian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 140452. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/33ac9c96-5c3d-45f2-8824-e786832d8c75.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '197 hour'),
  ('34412f11-6a54-467b-9a73-08713f9cebd6', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Vessel in the Form of a Warrior''s Helmet', 'I conceived this vessel as a compact armored presence, its tapering body rising like a helmeted figure and its stirrup handle giving it a quiet, animated strength. The red clay surface is restrained and earthy, broken by pale bands, a beaded medallion, and crosshatched forms that suggest armor, identity, and ritual use. I wanted the piece to feel both functional and symbolic, a small container with the solemn authority of a portrait object.

Moche — Art Institute of Chicago, object 6283. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome","figurative","folk art","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/34412f11-6a54-467b-9a73-08713f9cebd6.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '198 hour'),
