  ('3697e529-233d-41d9-be29-a18b57a5b935', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Salesman''s Sample', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 92791. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3697e529-233d-41d9-be29-a18b57a5b935.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '207 hour'),
  ('36a8cc10-deaa-4e0b-88c5-61917d5e8b34', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Farmer Requesting Permission to Marry a Nobleman''s Daughter', 'Gabriel Jacques de Saint-Aubin — Art Institute of Chicago, object 262600. Public domain (CC0).', '{"watercolour","graphite"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/36a8cc10-deaa-4e0b-88c5-61917d5e8b34.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '208 hour'),
  ('36fc66a2-759a-43dd-babf-0c31b064d6e3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Springtime', 'I have tried to let the trees, the low light, and the quiet path carry the painting’s atmosphere; the figures are there as a human warmth, small against the breadth of the woodland and water.

Théodore Rousseau — Art Institute of Chicago, object 894. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","landscape","figure study","botanical","vivid","realism","serene","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/36fc66a2-759a-43dd-babf-0c31b064d6e3.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '209 hour'),
  ('36fde620-18ec-4c9e-8fce-a0eff39cf468', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Slendang (Shawl)', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 27462. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/36fde620-18ec-4c9e-8fce-a0eff39cf468.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '210 hour'),
  ('374fa5a7-0a0c-430c-a02d-6728be85d8cb', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Old Oaks at Bas Bréau', 'In this forest study, I have tried to let the trunks rise with the slow weight of living timber, their bark marked by the patient pressure of line. The undergrowth gathers into a dark, restless floor, while the pale stems and openings behind hold a hush of air. What interests me most is the balance between enclosure and depth: the trees close in, yet the eye is drawn gradually into the light beyond.

Adolphe Martial Potémont — Art Institute of Chicago, object 71. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","desaturated","realism","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/374fa5a7-0a0c-430c-a02d-6728be85d8cb.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '211 hour'),
  ('377ee27f-881a-466c-923f-7053fe9fbde3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Wooden Spindle with Ceramic Whorl', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 226222. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/377ee27f-881a-466c-923f-7053fe9fbde3.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '212 hour'),
  ('37e1d039-1bf0-40be-9258-a6ac3c564605', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Salesman''s Sample (Waistcoat Pocket)', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 92810. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/37e1d039-1bf0-40be-9258-a6ac3c564605.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '213 hour'),
  ('37f8de23-c6f6-4787-89d0-bf47cbb5a6ef', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Portrait of a Lady', 'I made this oval portrait as a quiet study of presence: a pale relief figure held behind glass, framed by dark wood and caught in the uneven shine of reflection. The surface preserves the softness of modelling—flowers, lace, and ruffled cloth rendered almost as breath—while the cracked glass and shadowed ground give the figure an eerie, suspended stillness.

Charles Claude Dubut — Art Institute of Chicago, object 8332. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","portrait","desaturated","figurative","realism","solemn","contemplative","eerie"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/37f8de23-c6f6-4787-89d0-bf47cbb5a6ef.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '214 hour'),
