  ('3c6d1645-fa67-4ce1-ae34-5413908c4177', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Ship paintings', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 246751. Public domain (CC0).', '{"watercolour","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3c6d1645-fa67-4ce1-ae34-5413908c4177.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '230 hour'),
  ('3d329a65-d8ef-4ced-b7de-ab3ebabe046b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Papal Medal of Gregory XIV', 'Italian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 110162. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","portrait","floral","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3d329a65-d8ef-4ced-b7de-ab3ebabe046b.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '231 hour'),
  ('3d602232-52bb-42b9-a699-baf0a4423230', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Hara, from the series ""Fifty-three Stations of the Tokaido (Tokaido gojusan tsugi)""', 'A procession surges through the open plain beneath the immense, wind-struck face of Mount Fuji, its diagonal hatching giving the mountain a restless, almost volcanic force. Riders and attendants advance in colorful disorder, banners snapping against the sky, while the broad horizontal bands of road and water hold the scene in a measured, rhythmic balance. The composition turns travel into spectacle: worldly, animated, and quietly monumental, with the mountain looming over the fleeting human pageant below.

Katsushika Hokusai — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2914. Public domain (CC0).', '{"vivid","figurative","energetic","dramatic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3d602232-52bb-42b9-a699-baf0a4423230.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '232 hour'),
  ('3d896b06-f3e0-42c9-ada4-197a8f5fdcde', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Portrait of the Critic Gustave Geffroy', 'Marie Bracquemond — Art Institute of Chicago, object 202441. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3d896b06-f3e0-42c9-ada4-197a8f5fdcde.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '233 hour'),
  ('3d8eeba9-5fe8-4c2e-9a4e-5d7b331db77e', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Panorama of Paris, Taken from the Louvre', 'Unknown — Art Institute of Chicago, object 59127. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3d8eeba9-5fe8-4c2e-9a4e-5d7b331db77e.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '234 hour'),
  ('3d92857d-3cb4-41b1-8bee-108673591f09', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Python and a Gnu', 'Antoine Louis Barye — Art Institute of Chicago, object 102106. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","animal","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3d92857d-3cb4-41b1-8bee-108673591f09.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '235 hour'),
  ('3d9945e1-79ab-4a00-aaf2-6cdad766061a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'One Hundred Cranes 百鶴圖', 'Shen Quan — Art Institute of Chicago, object 75091. Public domain (CC0).', '{"muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3d9945e1-79ab-4a00-aaf2-6cdad766061a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '236 hour'),
  ('3da32803-6aec-4b03-acbb-6e4715359c26', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Breaker Boys Are No Longer Needed, This Is A Modern Breaker', 'I wanted the worker and the machine to share the frame, each absorbed in the other''s scale and motion. The belts, chains, and ironwork become a kind of architecture of labor, while the muted light keeps the scene quiet rather than heroic.

Lewis Wickes Hine — Art Institute of Chicago, object 23238. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated","realism","contemplative","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3da32803-6aec-4b03-acbb-6e4715359c26.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '237 hour'),
  ('3dbb5266-8264-4958-8055-43d8184eedb8', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Handkerchief', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 26743. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3dbb5266-8264-4958-8055-43d8184eedb8.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '238 hour'),
  ('3df8dc04-a1a3-4ae0-92dd-155ca3de27eb', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Bayard, les yeux Fermès', 'I wanted to hold a man suspended between repose and weathering, his body slouched against brick while the light settles into cloth, shadow, and age. The likeness carries a quiet gravity, less a formal pose than a moment of inward fatigue, dignity, and suspended thought.

Hippolyte Bayard — Art Institute of Chicago, object 23747. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","muted","realism","contemplative","melancholic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3df8dc04-a1a3-4ae0-92dd-155ca3de27eb.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '239 hour'),
  ('3e0245f9-60de-4e1b-a1d3-5a3f6b1929d3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Inscription on the Stone Drums, and the Bilou Stele: Calligraphy in Seal Script', 'Qian Daxin — Art Institute of Chicago, object 184638. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ink","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3e0245f9-60de-4e1b-a1d3-5a3f6b1929d3.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '240 hour'),
  ('3e1c9bd5-35c3-4594-adbb-a3068c873b7c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Death, from the series Fox Hunting', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3e1c9bd5-35c3-4594-adbb-a3068c873b7c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '241 hour'),
  ('3ee617c6-3b3f-4761-becf-bcb8a4addb57', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Virgin and Child with Saint Anne, Saint Gereon, and a Donor', 'I gather the sacred figures in a measured devotional arrangement, binding Virgin, Child, elder saint, armored guardian, and kneeling patron into one ordered vision of lineage and prayer. The radiant dove and gilded veil lift the scene toward divine presence, while the quiet landscape and carefully rendered faces hold earthly devotion in solemn balance.

Bartel Bruyn, the elder — Art Institute of Chicago, object 16329. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","landscape","vivid","figurative","realism","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3ee617c6-3b3f-4761-becf-bcb8a4addb57.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '242 hour'),
  ('3ee97ad1-3d95-4cf5-bc2f-add65f16b107', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Courtyard', 'A shadowed lane presses close around an old whitewashed wall, its timber and rough planes caught in a hard, luminous dark; beyond the arch the sea opens like a released breath, while the lone figure and his burden keep the scene humble, weathered, and watchful.

Alexandre Gabriel Decamps — Art Institute of Chicago, object 881. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","architecture","figure study","monochrome","realism","dramatic","contemplative","melancholic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3ee97ad1-3d95-4cf5-bc2f-add65f16b107.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '243 hour'),
  ('3f09b7ab-6820-4e40-a9df-2c1ee1c25d8a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Wall Pocket', 'Wedgwood Manufactory — Art Institute of Chicago, object 221311. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3f09b7ab-6820-4e40-a9df-2c1ee1c25d8a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '244 hour'),
  ('3f3f5ea3-fe36-42ab-8d10-3f24b4efb7ae', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Bridge Over the Ramapo at Greenwood, No. 6264 from the series "The Beauties of the Ramapo, Erie Railway"', 'Anthony and Company — Art Institute of Chicago, object 143716. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3f3f5ea3-fe36-42ab-8d10-3f24b4efb7ae.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '245 hour'),
  ('3f775f45-afc5-4977-804c-e0ffc042bf64', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Shadrach, Meshach and Abednego in the Fiery Furnace', 'Simeon Solomon — Art Institute of Chicago, object 263511. Public domain (CC0).', '{"watercolour","graphite","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3f775f45-afc5-4977-804c-e0ffc042bf64.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '246 hour'),
  ('3f9f6848-2acb-4c93-971d-ee35a25e9210', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Spinning Cloth, Preparing Tea Leaves, Preparing Silk', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 246763. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3f9f6848-2acb-4c93-971d-ee35a25e9210.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '247 hour'),
  ('3fb71d31-27bf-470c-8b82-d932198f38e3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Bodhisattva Maitreya with Fear-Not Gesture (Abhayamudra)', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 144735. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3fb71d31-27bf-470c-8b82-d932198f38e3.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '248 hour'),
  ('3fc0cd3c-50c6-4814-866f-e7cb36e8a11a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Ribbon', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 97097. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3fc0cd3c-50c6-4814-866f-e7cb36e8a11a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '249 hour'),
  ('4060699f-b342-4989-b79f-5458e2edf22a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Kawasaki, from the series "Fifty-three Stations of the Tokaido (Tokaido gojusan tsugi)"', 'I set the scene as a quiet interval on the road, where travelers and horse pause at the riverbank while a ferry carries its load through the current. I wanted the broad bands of water, cloud, and distant land to give the passage a calm, suspended rhythm, and the small figures to feel part of a larger movement of seasons, labor, and travel.

Katsushika Hokusai — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2890. Public domain (CC0).', '{"vivid","illustrative","serene","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/4060699f-b342-4989-b79f-5458e2edf22a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '250 hour'),
  ('40667e29-9dca-4941-bfc9-5140a575b556', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Head of a Man', 'Italian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 70960. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","sculpture","portrait","monochrome","black and white"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/40667e29-9dca-4941-bfc9-5140a575b556.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '251 hour'),
  ('4076d72a-26c0-4aa6-a3e9-bca7db68a7c1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Bowl with Peony Flowers', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 56801. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","muted","green dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/4076d72a-26c0-4aa6-a3e9-bca7db68a7c1.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '252 hour'),
  ('40f80997-cde3-4f05-aaa3-4e525c016fd5', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Loading Hay', 'Mihály Munkácsy — Art Institute of Chicago, object 263514. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","landscape","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/40f80997-cde3-4f05-aaa3-4e525c016fd5.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '253 hour'),
  ('416b6f3c-b78a-47f4-8c97-f8139301281a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Sun Pictures of Rocky Mountain Scenery', 'A quiet, dignified binding whose weathered green leather and restrained gilt lines give the volume an air of deliberate simplicity. Its worn edges and softened surfaces suggest long handling, careful shelving, and the accumulated grace of an object made to be read rather than merely displayed.

Andrew Joseph Russell — Art Institute of Chicago, object 11291. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated","minimalist","geometric","serene","nostalgic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/416b6f3c-b78a-47f4-8c97-f8139301281a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '254 hour'),
  ('41b14dd3-bbeb-4875-889a-e6a345a99a47', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'White heron and iris', 'Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 93005. Public domain (CC0).', '{"muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/41b14dd3-bbeb-4875-889a-e6a345a99a47.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '255 hour'),
  ('423fa91f-8a3e-4e00-9441-628d114270c4', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Putto', 'I carved this small wooden group as a study of movement and mischief: a winged child perched above a carved head, one hand lifting the bird so its feathers sweep upward like flame. The dark, burnished surface lets the grain and incised detail carry the warmth of the piece, while the tilted faces keep the whole thing light, almost teasing.

German — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25466. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","bird","monochrome","figurative","playful"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/423fa91f-8a3e-4e00-9441-628d114270c4.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '256 hour'),
  ('428e52c5-8375-4728-a06f-14f86125fb6c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Shipwreck', 'After Eugène Isabey — Art Institute of Chicago, object 57854. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","seascape","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/428e52c5-8375-4728-a06f-14f86125fb6c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '257 hour'),
  ('42b6d9f6-2dab-481b-ad50-b0502dec0fe6', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Descending Geese at Haneda (Haneda no rakugan), from the series "Eight Views in the Environs of Edo (Edo kinko hakkei…', 'I wanted the broad marsh to breathe with quiet water, wind, and the passing of birds, letting the small figures and clustered trees feel woven into a larger rhythm of shore and sky. The low horizon opens the scene outward, while the inked reeds, sails, and dark trees give the landscape its structure and pulse.

Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25256. Public domain (CC0).', '{"muted","serene","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/42b6d9f6-2dab-481b-ad50-b0502dec0fe6.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '258 hour'),
  ('42c4c8db-f454-4c14-8a3a-ffa7fd0b98d2', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Kanagawa: View over the Sea from the Teahouses on the Hill (Kanagawa, dai no chaya kaijo miharashi), no. 4 from the…', 'I gave the moon a quiet authority over the harbor, letting the blue water open into distance while boats, shore, and the lantern-lit inn hold the eye near the shore. Sails and ripples suggest passage, but the dark tree line and pale sky settle the night into a measured, watchful stillness.

Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25501. Public domain (CC0).', '{"vivid","blue dominant","illustrative","serene","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/42c4c8db-f454-4c14-8a3a-ffa7fd0b98d2.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '259 hour'),
  ('42d0ede6-0ace-4db1-af3f-1bc03a3dce08', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Traghetto, No. 2', 'James McNeill Whistler — Art Institute of Chicago, object 50973. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/42d0ede6-0ace-4db1-af3f-1bc03a3dce08.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '260 hour'),
  ('42d4f67e-7db4-4918-92d2-24c557fa8f43', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Bowl Depicting Row of Fish or Sharks Separated by Vertical Lines', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/42d4f67e-7db4-4918-92d2-24c557fa8f43.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '261 hour'),
  ('42f8e779-db11-4cd4-be19-797cd439db44', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Two Panels from a Skirt', 'I wanted this textile to feel like a garden remembered through hand and repetition: flowers and leaves growing in a steady rhythm across the blue field, each pierced surface catching light like a small opening in cloth. The white embroidery gives the pattern both delicacy and structure, turning ornament into something quiet, enduring, and intimate.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2529. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","desaturated","folk art","geometric","serene","nostalgic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/42f8e779-db11-4cd4-be19-797cd439db44.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '262 hour'),
  ('4344e8d0-47ee-498c-880f-5b58ce7be267', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Boy Waiting for Coal to Come Thru', 'Lewis Wickes Hine — Art Institute of Chicago, object 212123. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/4344e8d0-47ee-498c-880f-5b58ce7be267.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '263 hour'),
  ('44993f48-5ea0-49cc-96d2-e535fefeebcd', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Maria Sheldon Scammon', 'Anders Zorn — Art Institute of Chicago, object 39652. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","portrait","monochrome","black and white"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/44993f48-5ea0-49cc-96d2-e535fefeebcd.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '264 hour'),
  ('4516a604-a23f-4167-936f-f68d0d6cbf4c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Breaker Boys In Coal Chute, South Pittston, Pennsylvania', 'I wanted the mine’s darkness to gather around the men rather than swallow them, letting the lamp and the small windows carve faces out of the gloom. Their bodies, stacked through the shaft like strata, become a record of labor, patience, and the heavy dignity of a shared place.

Lewis Wickes Hine — Art Institute of Chicago, object 23285. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated","realism","solemn","dramatic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/4516a604-a23f-4167-936f-f68d0d6cbf4c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '265 hour'),
  ('451ca40d-831e-4350-a84b-791d9cdba0c1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'George Washington', 'Mintons Ltd. — Art Institute of Chicago, object 106059. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","ceramic","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/451ca40d-831e-4350-a84b-791d9cdba0c1.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '266 hour'),
  ('45b00275-6802-44ef-978d-645c7d34e00a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Versailles, Parterre d'' Eau', 'Jean-Eugène-Auguste Atget — Art Institute of Chicago, object 124300. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/45b00275-6802-44ef-978d-645c7d34e00a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '267 hour'),
