  ('460070c5-8dfb-4c28-b803-7cb55e18d7db', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Portion of a Chasuble', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25982. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/460070c5-8dfb-4c28-b803-7cb55e18d7db.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '270 hour'),
  ('46204dce-3331-4c4f-a6be-350ae316b9f9', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Cope', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 50886. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","floral","botanical","food","muted","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/46204dce-3331-4c4f-a6be-350ae316b9f9.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '271 hour'),
  ('46335a3e-af25-4967-89e7-e28c75223ba4', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Cuckoo and Azaleas (Hototogisu, satsuki)', 'I wanted the bird to move through the upper air as if its wing had just broken the hush of the scene, while the clustered blossoms below hold the eye with their warmth and density. The calligraphy, cloud forms, and patterned leaves are meant to feel of one hand—quiet, deliberate, and alive with seasonal attention.

Katsushika Hokusai — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25083. Public domain (CC0).', '{"muted","illustrative","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/46335a3e-af25-4967-89e7-e28c75223ba4.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '272 hour'),
