  ('4b0fd2ed-6cf2-48e3-86ee-5c70658d5f30', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Panel', 'I developed this textile as a lush, interlocking field of scrolling foliage and floral ornament, letting the metallic threads shimmer against the deep green ground. The design moves through repetition and counterpoint, balancing decorative abundance with a quiet, measured rhythm.

