  ('4d751233-fd85-49e4-861d-879adf9d3ca6', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Futakawa: Sarugababa Plateau (Futakawa, Sarugababa), from the series "Fifty-three Stations of the Tokaido (Tokaido…', 'Travelers pass through a hushed rural landscape beneath a pale sky, their small figures set against broad fields and wind-stirred vegetation. The composition balances quiet movement with expansive stillness, using rhythmic trees, diagonal ground, and layered space to evoke the measured pace of the road and the contemplative solitude of the journey.

