  ('4df22985-39b3-4111-9ab3-ea263e5ea94b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Daruma Overcoat (Haori Daruma), from "Three Pictures of Harmony (Waki sanpukutsui)"', 'I wanted the eye to pass through the group as through a folded screen: the high figure’s hooded silhouette, the two women bent toward the written sheet, and the patterned kimono opening into bamboo and grass like a private garden. Black line carries the poise of the bodies, while the yellowed ground and soft washes of orange, blue, and green hold the moment in a hush of cultivated leisure.

