  ('4ea05073-9a93-429d-b2dc-aefee5755c61', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Hydrangea and Swallow, from an untitled series of large flowers', 'I set the blossoms against a quiet field of yellow, allowing the pale heads to accumulate into repeated, almost mosaic clusters. A dark bird cuts across the composition with swift, graphic force, balancing the softness of stems, leaves, and bloom. I wanted the work to feel seasonal and enduring at once: a fleeting meeting of flower and wing held in decorative stillness.

