  ('53673ad4-1a34-40b1-a25e-4a21f5dd0edd', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Plate', 'I made this plate as a commemorative vessel, placing a portrait in the center beneath a border of repeating leaves. The scalloped rim and reserve-blue decoration give the surface a quiet ceremony, turning an object of use into a small monument of memory and civic reverence.

