  ('54ae010a-51cc-443e-b7e2-05ed6f4eea7b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Tale of Genji', 'I conceived the screen as a gilded field in which courtly life unfolds across shifting seasons and vantage points, the gold leaf carrying both atmosphere and architecture. Figures move between pavilions, gardens, bridges, and trees, their gestures and garments giving the composition its rhythm. I was drawn to the tension between decorative richness and quiet narrative, using layered space and seasonal motifs to suggest memory, ritual, and the passage of time.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 14780. Public domain (CC0).', '{"vivid","figurative","serene","romantic","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/54ae010a-51cc-443e-b7e2-05ed6f4eea7b.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '337 hour'),
  ('5512e802-506c-48e7-a779-62758622c696', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Apache Lake, Summit of Sierra Blanca Mountains, about 35 miles east from Camp Apache, Arizona, and 10.500 feet above…', 'Timothy O''Sullivan — Art Institute of Chicago, object 210805. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5512e802-506c-48e7-a779-62758622c696.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '338 hour'),
  ('55bd6e15-cdc3-4014-8b6e-8fac883a214f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Panel', 'I wanted the textile to feel like a cultivated garden growing outward from a central axis: flowers, fruit, grain, birds, and cherubs arranged in a formal rhythm that remains lively rather than rigid. The warm red ground and pale ornament give the pattern a ceremonial brightness, while the hand-printed irregularities keep it from becoming too perfect. It is decorative, but also a little theatrical—an ornamental world where abundance is allowed to flourish.

