  ('5c6de5e4-4ddf-4fd8-bea0-2d091c240a05', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Stamp Depicting a Plant-like Motf', 'I carved a face from earthen clay, letting the surface keep its rough, weathered grain. The features are reduced to deep cuts and repeated incisions: heavy eyes, a broad brow, and a mouth that narrows into a fan of vertical marks, as if the face were both mask and vessel. I wanted the object to feel old, guarded, and present, held together by the patience of its own lines.

