  ('5d61ac58-b567-4579-bd4e-cffbd3153aae', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'St. Laurence', 'I give the standing figure a grave and measured presence, letting the long folds of the robe fall with deliberate weight and the hand-held attributes speak quietly of martyrdom. The linear discipline of the engraving draws attention to contour, texture, and the restrained drama of the figure’s inward gaze, where devotion and endurance are held in careful balance.

Israhel van Meckenem, the younger — Art Institute of Chicago, object 3780. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated","figurative","realism","illustrative","solemn","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5d61ac58-b567-4579-bd4e-cffbd3153aae.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '370 hour'),
  ('5d69615d-170e-4346-bdee-e6849056914c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Mar''s Work, Stirling. No. 2', 'David Young Cameron — Art Institute of Chicago, object 51117. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5d69615d-170e-4346-bdee-e6849056914c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '371 hour'),
  ('5db665b6-801a-4d25-8d21-a65b66d70f4f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Italian Landscape', 'Heinrich Reinhold — Art Institute of Chicago, object 65848. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","landscape","botanical","floral","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5db665b6-801a-4d25-8d21-a65b66d70f4f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '372 hour'),
  ('5e4ded63-e823-4a08-bfcb-728037581c8c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Kesa', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 150732. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5e4ded63-e823-4a08-bfcb-728037581c8c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '373 hour'),
  ('5e7fa565-65f0-4af2-8bbe-b4d58b6090d3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Border', 'I work with a fine, open ground of thread, letting the ornament breathe through repeated knots, shadows, and broken light. The flowers and leaves move along the band like a quiet garden in rhythm, delicate but architectural, gathered into a strip of ornamental grace.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25152. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome","folk art","illustrative","serene","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5e7fa565-65f0-4af2-8bbe-b4d58b6090d3.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '374 hour'),
  ('5e89ea1b-36e8-471e-9c45-08b5068ace24', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Head of a Bearded Man', 'Ancient Cypriot — Art Institute of Chicago, object 108896. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5e89ea1b-36e8-471e-9c45-08b5068ace24.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '375 hour'),
  ('5ed18f90-0aef-4abc-993c-bd66aeb1e8f1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Portrait Bust of Comtesse d''Affry, née Lucie de Maillardoz (1816-1897)', 'Jean Baptiste Carpeaux — Art Institute of Chicago, object 41319. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","portrait","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5ed18f90-0aef-4abc-993c-bd66aeb1e8f1.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '376 hour'),
  ('5f06c4da-2a90-4421-bed5-46ef2dbc0b72', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Amulet of the God Thoth', 'Ancient Egyptian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 140919. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","textile","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5f06c4da-2a90-4421-bed5-46ef2dbc0b72.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '377 hour'),
  ('5f1a7078-bcbb-4e8d-9c8b-66f75e7a5837', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Apollo', 'Wedgwood Manufactory — Art Institute of Chicago, object 68159. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","ceramic","muted","blue dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5f1a7078-bcbb-4e8d-9c8b-66f75e7a5837.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '378 hour'),
  ('5f83ee0c-b23b-40a4-a573-1be3e9766b9a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Stoke-by-Nayland', 'I tried to keep the village alive as a place of weather, work, and passing light: the church rising beyond the trees, the road worn by cart and hoof, the sky in constant motion above the fields. The brushwork is meant to feel immediate and open, with colour carried in broken touches so that the scene breathes rather than settles into polish.

John Constable — Art Institute of Chicago, object 4758. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","landscape","botanical","animal","muted","impressionist","dramatic","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5f83ee0c-b23b-40a4-a573-1be3e9766b9a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '379 hour'),
  ('5f981dd3-6959-4a11-a488-32b2ac84b1f9', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Panel', 'I conceived this cloth as a quiet, repeating garden, arranging blossoms and scrolling foliage into a measured rhythm so the surface feels both rich and composed. The red-brown pigment warms the pale ground, and I let the ornament gather density without becoming loud, so the pattern carries a calm, ceremonial presence.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 1949. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","floral","botanical","muted","red dominant","abstract","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5f981dd3-6959-4a11-a488-32b2ac84b1f9.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '380 hour'),
  ('5fc0fa16-69e6-448d-a5d8-91ab05680ef6', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Fourth Knot', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5fc0fa16-69e6-448d-a5d8-91ab05680ef6.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '381 hour'),
