  ('61111b5d-f68c-42e8-8e4a-0c849b00d4d3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Nursery, with Britannia Reposing in Peace', 'James Gillray — Art Institute of Chicago, object 90104. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/61111b5d-f68c-42e8-8e4a-0c849b00d4d3.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '385 hour'),
  ('612467d2-9499-462f-b80b-9d394ed0e993', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Allegory of Winter', 'English — Art Institute of Chicago, object 34263. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/612467d2-9499-462f-b80b-9d394ed0e993.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '386 hour'),
  ('617d2e67-5abe-437f-a70d-86edbc851ad9', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Teapot', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 216871. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","vivid","blue dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/617d2e67-5abe-437f-a70d-86edbc851ad9.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '387 hour'),
  ('618ef72f-366d-4a98-9ab8-f173039e47fe', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fragment', 'Ancient Egyptian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 93587. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/618ef72f-366d-4a98-9ab8-f173039e47fe.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '388 hour'),
  ('61f9078d-7f29-4def-83f8-a13db2c3248d', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Portrait Bust of Eugene Guillaume, Sculptor', 'I have treated the portrait medal as a study in character rather than flattery: a compact field of bronze in which the profile, inscription, and incised detail compete for attention. The face is rendered with a sculptor’s economy—strong planes, dense hair, and a hard collar—while the surrounding lettering gives the bust its civic and commemorative weight. The surface is deliberately worked, with worn highlights and deep recesses that make age and authority feel inseparable from the likeness.

Jules Clément Chaplain — Art Institute of Chicago, object 605. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","portrait","desaturated","figurative","realism","dramatic","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/61f9078d-7f29-4def-83f8-a13db2c3248d.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '389 hour'),
  ('6203f1ce-4c62-44cb-8446-42899b95873a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Game of Chess', 'George Cruikshank — Art Institute of Chicago, object 90197. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6203f1ce-4c62-44cb-8446-42899b95873a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '390 hour'),
  ('6244f795-4ada-4a02-b7ff-788176ef39d0', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Squirrel and Grapes', 'Shen Yongling — Art Institute of Chicago, object 183287. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ink","vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6244f795-4ada-4a02-b7ff-788176ef39d0.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '391 hour'),
  ('627d8493-affc-4d52-838a-0b055121b031', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Purple Heron (Ardea purpurea)', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 142422. Public domain (CC0).', '{"watercolour","animal","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/627d8493-affc-4d52-838a-0b055121b031.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '392 hour'),
  ('62b6d9b6-96c1-43c2-9a01-ef1f641c0ee5', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Monkey Trainers and Scenes of Chinese Life (耕作図屏風)', 'Kano Yasunobu — Art Institute of Chicago, object 158486. Public domain (CC0).', '{"monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/62b6d9b6-96c1-43c2-9a01-ef1f641c0ee5.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '393 hour'),
  ('62de9ea9-efd6-40d4-af07-d959f81b1897', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Plate', 'I wanted Saldanha’s name to anchor a festive emblem of flowers, birds, fish, foliage, and small architectural emblems, all bound by gilded borders and bright enamel color. The plate becomes a ceremonial surface where nature, heraldry, and craft meet in a lively, radiant harmony.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2508. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","vivid","blue dominant","illustrative","playful"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/62de9ea9-efd6-40d4-af07-d959f81b1897.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '394 hour'),
  ('62f12528-d8a5-4563-bcee-c72485aed92d', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Miniature Jar with Rows of Geometric Motifs', 'Inca — Art Institute of Chicago, object 91477. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/62f12528-d8a5-4563-bcee-c72485aed92d.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '395 hour'),
  ('6348c1a2-aa04-4330-93fa-2b9c15fdc6a6', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fragment of a Statue of Venus', 'Ancient Roman — Art Institute of Chicago, object 40164. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6348c1a2-aa04-4330-93fa-2b9c15fdc6a6.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '396 hour'),
  ('636e16be-2a77-4aa5-9d7d-c97da8f45bbe', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Papal Medal of Innocent X', 'Italian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 110175. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","portrait","bird","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/636e16be-2a77-4aa5-9d7d-c97da8f45bbe.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '397 hour'),
  ('63b6d814-52b8-4299-8497-098c7d934d90', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Schooner Jane of Bath, Maine', 'I have set the scene at a quiet hour on the water, where sails, smoke, and reflected light move together beneath a broad evening sky. The sea holds the day’s last warmth, and the vessels pass with a measured calm, each form anchored in the shared breath of wind, tide, and distance.

William Bradford — Art Institute of Chicago, object 12535. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","muted","realism","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/63b6d814-52b8-4299-8497-098c7d934d90.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '398 hour'),
  ('63bf7c1c-6fda-47fb-9eab-a3091034bfd1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Oiso: Tora''s Rain (Oiso, Tora ga ame), from the series "Fifty-three Stations of the Tokaido Road (Tokaido gojusan…', 'I set the traveler''s road against a rain-soaked plain, where the slant of the weather draws the eye toward the clustered roofs and the dark line of the trees. The figures pass through the scene with quiet purpose, their forms simplified by wind and rain, while the broad fields, steep slopes, and patterned rain create a rhythm of movement across the composition. I aimed for a moment of everyday journeying to feel both transient and enduring: weather in motion, human passage, and the hush of a landscape held between storm and stillness.

Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25579. Public domain (CC0).', '{"muted","blue dominant","illustrative","dramatic","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/63bf7c1c-6fda-47fb-9eab-a3091034bfd1.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '399 hour'),
  ('6478ea84-40c5-4091-95f8-e0186bd91a07', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Plateau of Sebastopol', 'Roger Fenton — Art Institute of Chicago, object 123426. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6478ea84-40c5-4091-95f8-e0186bd91a07.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '400 hour'),
  ('64b63710-ffd4-4aa3-90dc-4bd606094639', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Draped Figure', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/64b63710-ffd4-4aa3-90dc-4bd606094639.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '401 hour'),
  ('650a2989-9047-4185-b792-74cbe197345f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Miniature Handled Bottle with Abstract Motifs', 'Tiwanaku — Art Institute of Chicago, object 90879. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/650a2989-9047-4185-b792-74cbe197345f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '402 hour'),
  ('65428c22-8802-4598-9c7d-fc4ed759a58d', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Miniature Jar with Textile Pattern or Abstract Fish Motifs', 'I shaped this vessel with a low, spreading body and a rounded rim, giving it the quiet presence of an object made to hold, gather, and remember. The warm earthen surface is broken by a rhythmic band of dark zigzag marks, where repetition becomes both decoration and a kind of measured pulse. I was drawn to the tension between the simplicity of the form and the restless energy of the pattern, letting age, wear, and mineral color soften the hand that made it.

Inca — Art Institute of Chicago, object 4847. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome","geometric","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/65428c22-8802-4598-9c7d-fc4ed759a58d.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '403 hour'),
  ('656d7eb4-9510-4246-9fa6-2f6549193eea', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Sign of White Horse, Parson''s Green', 'Theodore Roussel — Art Institute of Chicago, object 210969. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/656d7eb4-9510-4246-9fa6-2f6549193eea.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '404 hour'),
  ('658230e7-f984-4a8c-94af-6b28d687471d', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Head of a Woman', 'French — Art Institute of Chicago, object 31809. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","portrait","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/658230e7-f984-4a8c-94af-6b28d687471d.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '405 hour'),
  ('65c5c7a2-90ca-43d6-b413-f92e848a20ac', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Vase in the Form of a Tropical Plant with Bird and Deity', 'Paul Gauguin — Art Institute of Chicago, object 212301. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","ceramic","bird","botanical","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/65c5c7a2-90ca-43d6-b413-f92e848a20ac.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '406 hour'),
  ('65cd829c-2d45-4a04-9a5a-1b463f7dbc16', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Soup Bowl', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 216911. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/65cd829c-2d45-4a04-9a5a-1b463f7dbc16.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '407 hour'),
  ('66c8f5be-09e7-429f-bbed-6557c518ae04', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Elector Frederick III of Saxony, from Speculum intellectuale felicitatis humane', 'A stern and authoritative portrait, rendered with incisive, densely worked lines that model the fur mantle, embroidered garment, and weathered face without softening the sitter’s gravity. The arched frame and heraldic shields give the likeness a formal, emblematic presence, while the direct gaze and compressed space make the figure feel immediate and psychologically assertive.

Wolf Traut — Art Institute of Chicago, object 3070. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated","figurative","solemn","dramatic","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/66c8f5be-09e7-429f-bbed-6557c518ae04.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '408 hour'),
