  ('67879eaf-f072-47c4-8440-80b2ef610138', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Mii Temple in Omi Province, No. 14 on the Saikoku Pilgrimage Route (Saikoku junrei juyonban Omi Miidera), from the…', 'Utagawa Kunisada I (Toyokuni III) — Art Institute of Chicago, object 92253. Public domain (CC0).', '{"vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/67879eaf-f072-47c4-8440-80b2ef610138.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '414 hour'),
  ('67b6c2e9-862a-4e67-9a0f-b217c6735027', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Panel (Furnishing Fabric)', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 238470. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/67b6c2e9-862a-4e67-9a0f-b217c6735027.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '415 hour'),
  ('67cfa1ea-8d7b-4705-9724-891757c83afa', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'School of Fish', 'Soga Shohaku — Art Institute of Chicago, object 45753. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ink","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/67cfa1ea-8d7b-4705-9724-891757c83afa.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '416 hour'),
  ('67e5ed0e-1b1f-48a5-bfd0-03c99bc22181', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Plate', 'William Locke of Norbury, the Younger — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25813. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/67e5ed0e-1b1f-48a5-bfd0-03c99bc22181.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '417 hour'),
  ('680cedf5-7b4b-45c2-b273-fd729dc05532', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Head of a Man', 'I conceived this small ceramic head as a quiet study in presence and erosion: a figure emerging from roughened earth, its softened features and faint traces of color held against the austerity of a dark base. The surface is not polished into ideal beauty, but left porous, weathered, and human, as though memory itself had worn the face down to its essential stillness.

Ancient Greek — Art Institute of Chicago, object 349. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","sculpture","monochrome","figurative","solemn","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/680cedf5-7b4b-45c2-b273-fd729dc05532.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '418 hour'),
  ('6878c5b2-2766-4dfa-bce6-0053e4cfac1d', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Cléo de Mérode, from Treize Lithographies', 'Henri de Toulouse-Lautrec — Art Institute of Chicago, object 147123. Public domain (CC0).', '{"lithograph","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6878c5b2-2766-4dfa-bce6-0053e4cfac1d.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '419 hour'),
  ('68918634-3527-4821-9944-6e398cde8000', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', '"Star of Bethlehem" Quilt', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 202544. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/68918634-3527-4821-9944-6e398cde8000.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '420 hour'),
  ('68ac8901-faf8-4162-99ba-01dc2a9a634f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Seated Cat', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/68ac8901-faf8-4162-99ba-01dc2a9a634f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '421 hour'),
  ('68de2ef2-d05f-4f7b-945f-84fcd2e484e2', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Handle Spout Vessel in the Form of Blind Man Holding a Cup', 'I shaped the vessel around a single human presence, giving the container weight, posture, and a quiet authority. The reddish clay is allowed to remain visible beneath pale surfaces, with dark accents marking the headdress, ornaments, and small cup held in the hand. Behind the figure, the tubular form rises like an extension of breath or body, binding utility to ritual. I wanted the face to feel individual yet ceremonial, carved with restraint, patience, and inwardness.

Moche — Art Institute of Chicago, object 6352. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome","figurative","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/68de2ef2-d05f-4f7b-945f-84fcd2e484e2.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '422 hour'),
  ('69446822-afbc-411e-b7ec-ae7108bfc8a1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Free Doctor''s Visit Day (plate 16)', 'Charles Émile Jacque — Art Institute of Chicago, object 51171. Public domain (CC0).', '{"lithograph","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/69446822-afbc-411e-b7ec-ae7108bfc8a1.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '423 hour'),
  ('694615fb-d296-40b2-9426-e284cee0c37c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Entombment of Saint Catherine', 'I return to an old devotional grief and place it inside a fragile, gilded enclosure, where the bent angels and the recumbent body become a kind of private liturgy. The gold, umber, and bruised blue carry the feeling of an object worn by handling and memory, while the added strips and studs around the frame make the surface feel assembled like a relic rather than simply decorated. I wanted the scene to remain tender and severe at once: mournful, intimate, and suspended between ritual and present feeling.

Italian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25446. Public domain (CC0).', '{"vivid","blue dominant","figurative","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/694615fb-d296-40b2-9426-e284cee0c37c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '424 hour'),
  ('6994d76f-5a00-41c0-87b1-1114411499fd', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Drinking Vessel in the Form of a Head', 'I formed the vessel around a face that feels both personal and ceremonial, giving the clay a quiet, watchful presence. The ear forms and patterned band set up a rhythm across the surface, balancing the simplicity of the head with a charged, almost vocal energy.

Inca — Art Institute of Chicago, object 3624. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome","black and white","figurative","folk art","geometric","solemn","dreamlike"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6994d76f-5a00-41c0-87b1-1114411499fd.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '425 hour'),
  ('6a409f7c-39b5-42ca-85df-398ad60f2811', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Male Nude', 'Wilhelm von Gloeden — Art Institute of Chicago, object 210677. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6a409f7c-39b5-42ca-85df-398ad60f2811.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '426 hour'),
  ('6a6daeb6-307e-4d98-8eda-9d55d6fb9013', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fragment', 'I made this fragment as a study in dense ornament: a dark, almost nocturnal floral field woven over a subdued ground, where repeated blooms and scrolling vines settle into a measured, ceremonial rhythm. The worn edges and softened color keep the pattern from feeling finished or decorative alone; it holds instead as a small architecture of shadow, texture, and quiet repetition.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 1986. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome","abstract","solemn","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6a6daeb6-307e-4d98-8eda-9d55d6fb9013.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '427 hour'),
  ('6acc3a13-c698-4e13-821e-dd696d3b56e2', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Mise-en-carte (Point-paper)', 'Germain Frères — Art Institute of Chicago, object 148910. Public domain (CC0).', '{"gouache","textile","muted","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6acc3a13-c698-4e13-821e-dd696d3b56e2.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '428 hour'),
  ('6b171d97-5e45-4c6f-8fa6-27898a758258', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Forum Romanum, Rome', 'Bisson Frères — Art Institute of Chicago, object 123657. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","sculpture","architecture","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6b171d97-5e45-4c6f-8fa6-27898a758258.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '429 hour'),
  ('6b5245a5-4b81-4ff0-9900-2865c4e588ef', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Kichik Beg Wounded during Babur''s Attack on Qalat, from a copy of the Baburnama (Book of Babur)', 'Mughal — Art Institute of Chicago, object 140588. Public domain (CC0).', '{"watercolour","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6b5245a5-4b81-4ff0-9900-2865c4e588ef.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '430 hour'),
  ('6be203d5-aa2b-4cd0-8032-ced76250e6d2', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Aiken House, on Weldon Railroad, Virginia', 'John Reekie — Art Institute of Chicago, object 143458. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6be203d5-aa2b-4cd0-8032-ced76250e6d2.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '431 hour'),
  ('6c1b81c2-5102-446a-8fc4-15e40d2a965e', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Kneeling Mason', 'Charles Nègre — Art Institute of Chicago, object 100090. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6c1b81c2-5102-446a-8fc4-15e40d2a965e.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '432 hour'),
  ('6c4b6706-1cbb-4a5a-947d-97a0e40e5c10', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Portrait of the Princess di Ottaiano and her son Carlo', 'Marquis Filippo Petrone — Art Institute of Chicago, object 243167. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","portrait","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6c4b6706-1cbb-4a5a-947d-97a0e40e5c10.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '433 hour'),
  ('6c5c2bb4-1892-48bc-bcc6-1c3eef9f57b9', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Study from the Nude of a Girl Lying Down', 'Theodore Roussel — Art Institute of Chicago, object 210946. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6c5c2bb4-1892-48bc-bcc6-1c3eef9f57b9.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '434 hour'),
  ('6cbecbcc-c71e-4936-af0a-7b8ddc8e036a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Boy with Pitcher (La Régalade)', 'Édouard Manet — Art Institute of Chicago, object 29392. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","portrait"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6cbecbcc-c71e-4936-af0a-7b8ddc8e036a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '435 hour'),
  ('6ce01e95-6494-40f9-b411-82ec3c12e094', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Rhyl, The Pavilion', 'Francis Bedford — Art Institute of Chicago, object 38271. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6ce01e95-6494-40f9-b411-82ec3c12e094.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '436 hour'),
  ('6cefc0da-d5c4-4852-a8db-59cdf168810a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Stone panel carved in low relief with narrative scenes', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 142532. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6cefc0da-d5c4-4852-a8db-59cdf168810a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '437 hour'),
  ('6d40951b-d227-4843-a7c6-15f3a74238d0', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Rural Sports, or How to Show Off a Well-shaped Leg', 'A lively rural fête turns the swing into a stage for flirtation and social comedy, with a fashionable woman poised above the crowd while onlookers, dancers, and comic onlookers press into the scene. I wanted the picture to balance outdoor pleasure with a mischievous moral edge: the bright spring setting and animated gestures invite amusement, but the title’s sly emphasis on the displayed leg turns spectacle into a teasing commentary on vanity, courtship, and the theatricality of polite recreation.

Thomas Rowlandson — Art Institute of Chicago, object 3363. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","vivid","illustrative","folk art","playful","dramatic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6d40951b-d227-4843-a7c6-15f3a74238d0.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '438 hour'),
  ('6db41ca9-47e0-4354-8c2a-69afb34d3ed5', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Blue-and-White Stem Cup', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 32645. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","vivid","blue dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6db41ca9-47e0-4354-8c2a-69afb34d3ed5.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '439 hour'),
  ('6dc40e23-e859-46b2-ac36-8029151fec92', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Mastoid (Drinking Cup)', 'I give the vessel a warm earthen ground and set dark, swift figures across its surface, letting the white accents brighten gesture and presence. The figures move with a measured urgency, as if caught in a procession or contest, their bodies drawn into the curve of the pot so that the decoration follows the hand and the eye together.

Caylus Painter — Art Institute of Chicago, object 176. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","animal","desaturated","figurative","energetic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6dc40e23-e859-46b2-ac36-8029151fec92.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '440 hour'),
  ('6dc78fde-e1f7-4f4e-bcb3-cdcb841edc8a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'South Sea Guanyin', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6dc78fde-e1f7-4f4e-bcb3-cdcb841edc8a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '441 hour'),
  ('6def6a20-ad95-4229-9868-ef0ebf149934', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Scarabs with Inscriptions on Base', 'Ancient Egyptian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 140254. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","textile","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6def6a20-ad95-4229-9868-ef0ebf149934.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '442 hour'),
  ('6e0c5d58-1b67-4683-8606-ae65f1f7c018', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Amphora (Storage Jar)', 'I shape the vessel as a stage for bodies and symbols: a dark ground carries terracotta figures in poised, charged contact, while winged beasts and repeated ornament circle the surface like remembered rites. The paint is not merely decoration; it sets flesh, gesture, and pattern in a measured dialogue, letting the ancient language of line and clay speak with immediate presence.

Ancient Greek — Art Institute of Chicago, object 242. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome","figurative","dramatic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6e0c5d58-1b67-4683-8606-ae65f1f7c018.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '443 hour'),
  ('6e783a33-e30c-4628-b360-92d9780c3b75', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Pendents (For Bed Curtains)', 'Manchu — Art Institute of Chicago, object 151598. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6e783a33-e30c-4628-b360-92d9780c3b75.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '444 hour'),
  ('6e7f2247-2737-4abc-b841-807440db6fb2', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Yo Semite Reflected in Merced River, Yo Semite Valley, California, from the series "Yo Semite Valley, Cal."', 'J. J. Reilly & Co. — Art Institute of Chicago, object 108773. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6e7f2247-2737-4abc-b841-807440db6fb2.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '445 hour'),
  ('6f4327f7-2673-4754-b568-620a7d806a60', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Animal Locomotion, Plate 174', 'Eadweard Muybridge — Art Institute of Chicago, object 212169. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6f4327f7-2673-4754-b568-620a7d806a60.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '446 hour'),
