  ('700f33f7-ad98-4357-980d-42cbe89e5fcf', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Melrose Abbey', 'William Henry Fox Talbot — Art Institute of Chicago, object 144501. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/700f33f7-ad98-4357-980d-42cbe89e5fcf.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '448 hour'),
  ('70448218-4bd9-437d-b968-8b23617a29cf', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Border', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 27345. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/70448218-4bd9-437d-b968-8b23617a29cf.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '449 hour'),
  ('70a85dc7-8db6-4fda-b22d-661767f051f3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Elizabeth Grant Bankson Beatty (Mrs. James Beatty) and Her Daughter Susan', 'Joshua Johnson — Art Institute of Chicago, object 150054. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","portrait","crowd","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/70a85dc7-8db6-4fda-b22d-661767f051f3.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '450 hour'),
  ('70e90e5b-5d21-45af-a4b4-9ecc7874bcc0', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Figure of Bravery (Herzhaftigkeit)', 'Wilhelm Christian Meyer — Art Institute of Chicago, object 96794. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","ceramic","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/70e90e5b-5d21-45af-a4b4-9ecc7874bcc0.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '451 hour'),
  ('71e2901c-58e4-49ab-ac30-80736adb9cdd', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Design for a Printed Textile', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 50505. Public domain (CC0).', '{"watercolour","textile","graphite","vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/71e2901c-58e4-49ab-ac30-80736adb9cdd.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '452 hour'),
  ('7221a5db-fd1e-4161-9440-3e38d707b70c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Coast of Labrador', 'William Bradford — Art Institute of Chicago, object 100489. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","landscape","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/7221a5db-fd1e-4161-9440-3e38d707b70c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '453 hour'),
  ('7293667e-001d-4042-b934-baddc1976940', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Elephant, from The Berain Grotesques Series', 'I conceived this woven piece as a richly ornamented world of gardens, architecture, flowers, and living creatures, where ceremonial figures move through draped fabrics, scrolling foliage, and gilded abundance. Its pageantry is balanced by a sense of playful discovery, inviting the eye to wander through layers of color, pattern, and imagined spectacle.

Jean Baptiste Monnoyer — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2102. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid","blue dominant","figurative","illustrative","playful"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/7293667e-001d-4042-b934-baddc1976940.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '454 hour'),
  ('72a7a1db-8ae4-4d1d-aae7-91f87e55082c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Statuette of Herakles', 'Ancient Etruscan — Art Institute of Chicago, object 72225. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/72a7a1db-8ae4-4d1d-aae7-91f87e55082c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '455 hour'),
  ('72babade-8422-486e-80cf-4528d674fa21', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Arjuna Slays Karna, page from a Mahabharata series', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 180204. Public domain (CC0).', '{"watercolour","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/72babade-8422-486e-80cf-4528d674fa21.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '456 hour'),
  ('730a7170-9b23-4be5-ae95-0f727456e683', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fan', 'I have composed a delicate folding fan as a portable pastoral tableau, where painted figures, flowering borders, and distant scenery unfold together like a quiet narrative. The ornamental ribs and airy paper surface invite the hand to move, revealing a charming meeting of landscape, figure, and floral decoration.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 582. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome","illustrative","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/730a7170-9b23-4be5-ae95-0f727456e683.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '457 hour'),
  ('7312243d-52d0-4422-b7cb-2ff267fe0024', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Dish (Coppa Amatoria)', 'I shaped this ceramic plate as a small courtly portrait, setting a calm young woman against a deep blue ground so that her pale face, golden hair, and white garment would carry the eye. The scrolling inscription and decorative borders give the piece a heraldic, emblem-like presence, while the restrained expression keeps the figure dignified and composed.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25404. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","vivid","figurative","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/7312243d-52d0-4422-b7cb-2ff267fe0024.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '458 hour'),
  ('7346ec8c-0506-462d-b5fe-80f8ffd6c73c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Farm', 'Louis Oscar Roty — Art Institute of Chicago, object 143896. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","botanical","animal","bird","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/7346ec8c-0506-462d-b5fe-80f8ffd6c73c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '459 hour'),
  ('7376c3d0-b8d7-4bab-9c7b-e159ec1f8346', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Miniature Flared Bowl Depicting Trophy Heads and Abstract Peppers', 'I formed the bowl as a quiet field for pattern: a warm earthen body circled by stylized creatures and angular marks, drawn in black, white, and red like a story carried around the rim. I wanted the surface to feel ceremonial yet alive, holding the steadiness of clay with the quick rhythm of a remembered tale.

Nasca — Art Institute of Chicago, object 4750. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome","geometric","folk art","serene","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/7376c3d0-b8d7-4bab-9c7b-e159ec1f8346.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '460 hour'),
  ('739d934c-25cf-4757-ae56-916f9f5280d1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fragment', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/739d934c-25cf-4757-ae56-916f9f5280d1.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '461 hour'),
  ('73f0de18-efdf-428b-9a6c-581b5fca1788', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Adoration of the Eucharist', 'I have composed this devotional altarpiece as a union of solid architecture and heavenly vision: columns, arches, and the dark central shrine gather the eye, while angels, clouds, and kneeling saints raise the whole into an atmosphere of worship and revelation.

Peter Paul Rubens — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25790. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","figure study","vivid","figurative","solemn","dramatic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/73f0de18-efdf-428b-9a6c-581b5fca1788.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '462 hour'),
  ('74326dfd-1625-46f7-8ad2-b7b4d2c5474e', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'La Ratisseuse (The Turnip Scraper)', 'François Bernard Lépicié — Art Institute of Chicago, object 202417. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/74326dfd-1625-46f7-8ad2-b7b4d2c5474e.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '463 hour'),
  ('74934609-afd1-4c67-a922-59696efd1866', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Le Moulin: Paul Restauranteur', 'An old stone house stands weathered and quiet among deep trees, its rough masonry, steep roof, and small windows gathering the weight of time. The composition favors texture, shadow, and stillness over detail, giving the building a near-monumental presence within a hushed rural setting.

Hippolyte Bayard — Art Institute of Chicago, object 23762. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated","realism","contemplative","nostalgic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/74934609-afd1-4c67-a922-59696efd1866.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '464 hour'),
