  ('8033be5c-20fc-42cf-a79c-fb632e6b00f2', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Flagellation of Christ', 'Jacopo Negretti, called Palma Giovane — Art Institute of Chicago, object 202160. Public domain (CC0).', '{"gouache"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8033be5c-20fc-42cf-a79c-fb632e6b00f2.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '508 hour'),
  ('80c28c78-7a41-45b1-9dad-3a95ee6fc0cb', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Birdstone', 'I shaped the piece around a long, birdlike tension, reducing the body to a dark, polished sweep with a pointed beak and small openings that feel at once functional and incantatory. The surface is kept severe and low-key, so the weight of the form, the restrained silhouette, and the sense of concealed use carry the work more than decoration.

Archaic — Art Institute of Chicago, object 5983. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","monochrome","abstract","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/80c28c78-7a41-45b1-9dad-3a95ee6fc0cb.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '509 hour'),
  ('811f9539-9348-406b-92a7-489b98a21247', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Old priest and tea kettle.', 'Gyokudô — Art Institute of Chicago, object 28215. Public domain (CC0).', '{"monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/811f9539-9348-406b-92a7-489b98a21247.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '510 hour'),
  ('8154e455-3ffb-425d-9ee2-98df500b9797', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fragment', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 50477. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8154e455-3ffb-425d-9ee2-98df500b9797.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '511 hour'),
  ('815ea541-9689-4060-a2da-786ee588be73', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Figure of a Girl', 'I modelled this small ceramic figure as a softly dressed woman in a rose-toned coat and dark hat, carrying a bowl of flowers. The painted outlines, patterned skirt, and bright accents give her a delicate, playful presence, poised between ceremony and everyday charm.

Limbach Porcelain Factory — Art Institute of Chicago, object 20223. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","ceramic","muted","red dominant","figurative","playful","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/815ea541-9689-4060-a2da-786ee588be73.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '512 hour'),
