  ('828e418d-ffd8-4d4e-b190-5069f5f0d5d2', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Landscape with Figures and Buildings', 'French — Art Institute of Chicago, object 36508. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","landscape","architecture","figure study","botanical","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/828e418d-ffd8-4d4e-b190-5069f5f0d5d2.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '515 hour'),
  ('8310695c-b118-4384-b407-860e619e3556', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Teapot with Symbols of England, Ireland, and Scotland', 'I made this vessel as a dialogue between utility and ornament, letting the porcelain body glow with a warm amber lustre beneath white floral relief and rose-pink accents. The curved spout and handle give the form a light, almost dancing profile, while the painted leaf bands and raised blossoms turn a domestic object into a small, decorative still life.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 5407. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","vivid","red dominant","art nouveau","romantic","playful"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8310695c-b118-4384-b407-860e619e3556.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '516 hour'),
  ('834bc664-c069-4066-a1ae-1e251331433f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Medal Depicting Pope Clement VII (1478–1534)', 'Antonio Francesco Selvi — Art Institute of Chicago, object 144086. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","portrait","botanical","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/834bc664-c069-4066-a1ae-1e251331433f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '517 hour'),
  ('83657f23-c5e3-4e7f-8d57-c669d79ce147', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Soup Bowl', 'I conceived this ceramic dish as a ceremonial field of flowers and script, with a crowned calligraphic emblem held between small figures at its heart. Around it, gilded vines and cobalt blossoms trace the scalloped edge, so that the plate reads as both a vessel and a heraldic garden, delicate in execution but stately in bearing.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2606. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","vivid","blue dominant","figurative","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/83657f23-c5e3-4e7f-8d57-c669d79ce147.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '518 hour'),
  ('83c719aa-d9c9-47e9-8980-f62756d44dac', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Plate', 'Herculaneum Pottery Co. — Art Institute of Chicago, object 65869. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/83c719aa-d9c9-47e9-8980-f62756d44dac.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '519 hour'),
  ('83d3ee4e-9587-4e9c-8fa1-d66aff6cb932', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'A Vanitas Still Life with a Flag, Candlestick, Musical Instruments, Books, Writing Paraphernalia, Globes, and Hourglass', 'Edwaert Collier — Art Institute of Chicago, object 258490. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","still life","map","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/83d3ee4e-9587-4e9c-8fa1-d66aff6cb932.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '520 hour'),
  ('83e90f1f-bbaf-4830-a936-03c3d1ee5dbf', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Virgin and Child', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/83e90f1f-bbaf-4830-a936-03c3d1ee5dbf.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '521 hour'),
  ('842502c3-eb71-40fb-9830-78ba9e87312c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Krishna''s Fifth and Sixth Avatars, page from a copy of the Gitagovinda of Jayaveda', 'I set the scene in two adjoining fields, using a dark royal chamber and a blazing yellow arena to turn one encounter into a study of power and upheaval. The seated sovereign holds the stillness of authority, while the blue figure moves with swift, ceremonial force, the repeated arms and weapons opening the scene into violence. I let the saturated blues, golds, and reds press against one another, so the ornament of the court does not soften the tension but sharpens it.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 13120. Public domain (CC0).', '{"watercolour","vivid","figurative","illustrative","dramatic","tense"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/842502c3-eb71-40fb-9830-78ba9e87312c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '522 hour'),
