  ('848bf362-9ee8-43ab-9d64-6a3e1c4b4729', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Panel', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 148989. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","floral","botanical","vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/848bf362-9ee8-43ab-9d64-6a3e1c4b4729.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '525 hour'),
  ('84a9772c-f759-4501-a860-d8cb5c582d72', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Colonnade and Gardens of the Medici Palace', 'Style of Hubert Robert — Art Institute of Chicago, object 30368. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","architecture","botanical","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/84a9772c-f759-4501-a860-d8cb5c582d72.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '526 hour'),
  ('84d14a66-2432-49c8-92a6-4e4f88cab69b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Corbel with Portrait Bust Holding Instrument in Mouth from the Monastery Church of Notre-Dame-de-la-Grande-Sauve', 'I carved a solitary head into the stone, enlarged until breath, voice, and burden seemed to share one swollen face. The hands gather around the form like a vessel or instrument, making the figure both singer and sound, while the severe surround presses the face forward into shadow.

French — Art Institute of Chicago, object 14438. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","portrait","figure study","monochrome","figurative","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/84d14a66-2432-49c8-92a6-4e4f88cab69b.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '527 hour'),
  ('84e18204-a339-490b-8f2a-2caa2ab02ee8', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Nymphs Bathing', 'Dirck van der Lisse — Art Institute of Chicago, object 35280. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","botanical","landscape","nude","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/84e18204-a339-490b-8f2a-2caa2ab02ee8.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '528 hour'),
  ('84fc126f-1f98-4299-b280-1f82506869ca', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Improvisation No. 30 (Cannons)', 'I wanted the canvas to vibrate like an inner storm, with color and line set against one another until form, atmosphere, and emotion became inseparable. Cloud, water, and earth dissolve into a charged rhythm of arcs, lines, and luminous planes, suggesting renewal and upheaval at once.

Vasily Kandinsky — Art Institute of Chicago, object 8991. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","muted","abstract","expressionist","dramatic","energetic","dreamlike"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/84fc126f-1f98-4299-b280-1f82506869ca.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '529 hour'),
