  ('88647350-fab3-4dd2-bd15-23fcf6de5d0f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Large Hanging with Crown and Escutcheon', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 152180. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","bird","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/88647350-fab3-4dd2-bd15-23fcf6de5d0f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '542 hour'),
  ('88819a72-1d8f-4750-945f-c21c983c8922', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fragment', 'I let the floral ornament breathe as a weathered, almost architectural surface, its scrolling vines and clustered blossoms pressed into a quiet monochrome field. The pattern feels both decorative and ancient, half ornament, half memory, opening into a space where repetition becomes rhythm and age softens the edges into shadow.

