  ('8c13efff-1e45-4759-a744-e98d4f2483f1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Embers Glow', 'Theodore Roussel — Art Institute of Chicago, object 211039. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8c13efff-1e45-4759-a744-e98d4f2483f1.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '554 hour'),
  ('8cf3e054-b905-4aa2-bd9f-2da9656dea60', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Border (Furnishing)', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 26102. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8cf3e054-b905-4aa2-bd9f-2da9656dea60.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '555 hour'),
  ('8d57679f-1ae4-4f7c-be7c-491eb3a8535f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Zuni Indian Girl, with water olla, No. 17 from the series "Geographical Explorations and Surveys West of the 100th…', 'Timothy O''Sullivan — Art Institute of Chicago, object 210772. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8d57679f-1ae4-4f7c-be7c-491eb3a8535f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '556 hour'),
  ('8d8a0bc5-cfca-40b7-81c2-6c129b901109', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Bone Pick', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 226146. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8d8a0bc5-cfca-40b7-81c2-6c129b901109.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '557 hour'),
  ('8dae4f08-82bd-43a0-9e9a-7c576eb36771', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Miniature Pyxis (Container for Personal Objects)', 'I conceived this vessel as a quiet, utilitarian form enriched by hand-painted botanical marks, where the black linework moves across the surface like growth traced onto warm clay. The lid, handles, and shallow base give it a ceremonial stillness, while the painted leaves and stems keep the object rooted in natural rhythm.

Ancient Greek — Art Institute of Chicago, object 282. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome","abstract","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8dae4f08-82bd-43a0-9e9a-7c576eb36771.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '558 hour'),
  ('8db4f7e6-00fe-450a-881c-d17443036d2a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Valance', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 53027. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8db4f7e6-00fe-450a-881c-d17443036d2a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '559 hour'),
  ('8dee3031-c2fe-4dfb-8b21-1cf03c0b4287', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Bedroom', 'Vincent van Gogh — Art Institute of Chicago, object 28560. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","interior","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8dee3031-c2fe-4dfb-8b21-1cf03c0b4287.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '560 hour'),
  ('8e863f50-601b-4fa2-a8c4-39530dea61e9', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Virgin and Child', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8e863f50-601b-4fa2-a8c4-39530dea61e9.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '561 hour'),
  ('8efc846e-e45f-4aa3-b105-151f4384c0a3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Corbel with Animal Mask Sprouting Leaves from the Monastery Church of Notre-Dame-de-la-Grande-Sauve', 'French — Art Institute of Chicago, object 219300. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","animal","architecture","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8efc846e-e45f-4aa3-b105-151f4384c0a3.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '562 hour'),
  ('8f4bb62a-5157-4a59-8f1f-36fcf6451725', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Bust of Seleucus Nicator of Syria', 'I sought to give the bust a compact monumentality: a dark, polished head and shoulders gathered into stillness, with the face held between severity and inward attention. The contrast of the black surface and pale support gives the figure a quiet gravity, while the restrained features invite contemplation without explanation.

Sabatino de Angelis — Art Institute of Chicago, object 671. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","portrait","monochrome","figurative","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8f4bb62a-5157-4a59-8f1f-36fcf6451725.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '563 hour'),
  ('8f64440b-c95e-40d6-ab4f-05e0f75feab1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Ely Cathedral: Nave to East, from Octagon Arch', 'Frederick H. Evans — Art Institute of Chicago, object 215575. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8f64440b-c95e-40d6-ab4f-05e0f75feab1.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '564 hour'),
  ('8fa1d6ce-09c1-4c18-a1bb-5fb196d07fb6', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Panel', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 26237. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8fa1d6ce-09c1-4c18-a1bb-5fb196d07fb6.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '565 hour'),
  ('8fa969ba-f482-43bf-81c6-9cddcccceefc', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fragment (From an Orphrey Band)', 'I made this fragment as a devotional textile, weaving a radiant central sun into a field of floral and cloud forms. The worn edges and subdued rose, olive, and gold ground are part of the work’s presence: a quiet emblem of light preserved through age, ornament, and touch.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 1858. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid","illustrative","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8fa969ba-f482-43bf-81c6-9cddcccceefc.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '566 hour'),
  ('8fdeded4-28d5-4aa1-8d08-6e4fc706c4ee', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'God Vishnu with Goddesses Lakshmi and Sarasvati', 'I carved a dark, monumental relief in which a four-armed divine figure stands at the center, crowned and haloed, holding emblems of authority and grace. Around him the surface swells with attendants, lotus forms, and carved ornament, turning the panel into a field of devotion and ceremonial stillness.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 14845. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","desaturated","figurative","solemn","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8fdeded4-28d5-4aa1-8d08-6e4fc706c4ee.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '567 hour'),
  ('90392d7a-9cc5-4fcf-9887-923d7ddd8962', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'A Greek Warrior Attacked by a Leopard', 'Anthelme-François Lagrenée — Art Institute of Chicago, object 265416. Public domain (CC0).', '{"watercolour","gouache","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/90392d7a-9cc5-4fcf-9887-923d7ddd8962.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '568 hour'),
  ('908426f4-c0b8-4e20-96dd-486b783e67c6', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Leamington, in the Jephson Gardens', 'Francis Bedford — Art Institute of Chicago, object 38316. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/908426f4-c0b8-4e20-96dd-486b783e67c6.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '569 hour'),
  ('910e90e1-92f4-47fd-9009-9d0c19ec280b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Otsu: Distant View of Otsu and the Lake from the Kannon Hall of Mii Temple (Otsu, Miidera Kannondo yori Otsu no machi…', 'At Otsu I wanted the traveler’s path to feel both temporary and timeless: temple roofs and trees in the foreground, boats and reeds across the water, and Fuji holding the distant air in quiet authority. The scene moves gently from human passage to vast landscape, so that a brief journey becomes an act of looking.

Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25541. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated","illustrative","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/910e90e1-92f4-47fd-9009-9d0c19ec280b.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '570 hour'),
  ('919d0013-ba35-4d8d-a4be-4683b501dbae', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Papal Medal of Innocent XI', 'Italian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 110187. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","portrait","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/919d0013-ba35-4d8d-a4be-4683b501dbae.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '571 hour'),
  ('91ec486c-60a5-47d9-a332-12be66d50887', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Flounce', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 143842. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/91ec486c-60a5-47d9-a332-12be66d50887.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '572 hour'),
  ('92074ee1-dd93-43c1-82fe-2027a014f46b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Are They Thinking about the Grape? (Pensent-ils au raisin?)', 'François Boucher — Art Institute of Chicago, object 44742. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","animal","figure study","food","landscape","botanical","muted","blue dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/92074ee1-dd93-43c1-82fe-2027a014f46b.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '573 hour'),
  ('92f946b6-0448-4871-b56f-e81817f1d65e', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Babies Cap', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 53246. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/92f946b6-0448-4871-b56f-e81817f1d65e.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '574 hour'),
  ('934bc7ad-e6a7-4d4a-8d52-803c491183cb', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Waistcoat Design', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 96814. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","floral","vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/934bc7ad-e6a7-4d4a-8d52-803c491183cb.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '575 hour'),
  ('9406c9f5-df8b-4824-82de-c0d45161f455', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Deposition', 'I carved the marble as a field of grief and grace, where the body of Christ falls through a space filled with mourning figures, angels, and sacred light. The folded stone becomes both altar and threshold, holding sorrow without resolving it—only allowing the eye to move from the broken body to the cross, and from grief toward the faint promise above.

Antonio D''Este — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25221. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","monochrome","figurative","solemn","dramatic","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/9406c9f5-df8b-4824-82de-c0d45161f455.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '576 hour'),
  ('9423ff45-f9e6-4a34-9cf6-7d9d5c46736b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Dish', 'William De Morgan & Company — Art Institute of Chicago, object 28615. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/9423ff45-f9e6-4a34-9cf6-7d9d5c46736b.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '577 hour'),
  ('94290540-6eff-4e98-b3fb-fcaf2e9a5346', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Amulet of Pataikos', 'Ancient Egyptian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 140649. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","textile","vivid","green dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/94290540-6eff-4e98-b3fb-fcaf2e9a5346.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '578 hour'),
  ('945c7dd2-3482-4546-b485-b97d163b7db8', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Poem by Kanke, from the series "One Hundred Poems Explained by the Nurse (Hyakunin isshu uba ga etoki)"', 'I wanted to catch the measured drama of a road journey: a richly dressed carriage moving through autumn air, its curved roof and patterned panels held against the open sky. The attendants, lanterns, ox, and scattered maple leaves give the scene a sense of ceremony and motion, while the pale distance and steady trees keep the moment calm, orderly, and quietly nostalgic.

Katsushika Hokusai — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25218. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated","illustrative","serene","nostalgic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/945c7dd2-3482-4546-b485-b97d163b7db8.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '579 hour'),
  ('947bbb7c-1be3-470f-bd09-a6cdf92231b2', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Plate with Female Bust', 'I conceived this ceramic plate as a radiance of color and ornament, with the botanical scrollwork blooming outward from the central portrait as if the vessel itself were flowering. The vivid blues, yellows, greens, and warm browns are meant to feel lively and celebratory, while the profile medallion gives the surface an intimate, almost personal presence.

Castel Durante Potteries — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25370. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","vivid","folk art","joyful"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/947bbb7c-1be3-470f-bd09-a6cdf92231b2.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '580 hour'),
  ('94f17fb1-d06f-45e8-a8ce-bcb0390d95ce', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Orphrey Band', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/94f17fb1-d06f-45e8-a8ce-bcb0390d95ce.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '581 hour'),
  ('9538b7fc-ca17-406d-b093-e89c61a0cc58', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Marriage of the Virgin', 'I have worked in fine engraved line to give the figures a grave and ceremonial presence, letting architecture frame the encounter and the pale drapery gather the eye toward the central figures. The scene is held in a restrained tonal range, with light and shadow carrying the emotional weight rather than colour.

Schelte Adamsz. Bolswert — Art Institute of Chicago, object 33. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated","figurative","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/9538b7fc-ca17-406d-b093-e89c61a0cc58.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '582 hour'),
  ('957250e9-74bc-47d0-9c5f-417ae76374cc', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Nevada Fall (700 feet high), From Foot-Bridge, after Snow Storm in July, No. 1208 from the series "California --…', 'John P. Soule — Art Institute of Chicago, object 143987. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/957250e9-74bc-47d0-9c5f-417ae76374cc.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '583 hour'),
  ('95743a5c-7d2f-4784-bbfc-eafb2340fbff', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Fountains', 'Hubert Robert — Art Institute of Chicago, object 57051. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","architecture","landscape","animal","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/95743a5c-7d2f-4784-bbfc-eafb2340fbff.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '584 hour'),
  ('95c31c3b-b5c9-4fe8-badd-e6f0c16af287', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Maisaka—No. 31, from the series "Fifty-three Stations of the Tokaido (Tokaido gojusan tsugi)," also known as the…', 'Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25835. Public domain (CC0).', '{"vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/95c31c3b-b5c9-4fe8-badd-e6f0c16af287.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '585 hour'),
  ('95c975f5-020f-4ba5-bb69-18d9e0eb4241', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Military Bridge, Across the Chickahominy, Virginia', 'D. B. Woodbury — Art Institute of Chicago, object 143652. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/95c975f5-020f-4ba5-bb69-18d9e0eb4241.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '586 hour'),
  ('95d19538-ff66-4cc5-8f32-d7c643dd0185', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Versailles, Vase par Ballin', 'Jean-Eugène-Auguste Atget — Art Institute of Chicago, object 124230. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/95d19538-ff66-4cc5-8f32-d7c643dd0185.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '587 hour'),
  ('95f4473c-5bd6-4a81-9ea6-83751b6aff2f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Banks of the Marne in Winter', 'I sought to give the road, the bare trees, and the low village their full share of presence, as if the land itself were breathing beneath a heavy sky. The figures on the path are there to humanize the distance, not to command it; the houses and church stand quietly within the slope of the hills. I wanted the green fields, the dark earth, and the shifting clouds to speak together in a subdued harmony, where atmosphere and light transform an ordinary view into something intimate and enduring.

Camille Pissarro — Art Institute of Chicago, object 6005. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","botanical","figure study","architecture","landscape","monochrome","impressionist","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/95f4473c-5bd6-4a81-9ea6-83751b6aff2f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '588 hour'),
  ('961f218e-a73f-4438-8fde-e71f9816981a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Guitarist for the Monkey Band', 'Meissen Porcelain Manufactory — Art Institute of Chicago, object 146699. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","ceramic","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/961f218e-a73f-4438-8fde-e71f9816981a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '589 hour'),
  ('96fff19e-4f44-44da-b84d-8d98edabe144', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Amulet of Djed Column', 'Ancient Egyptian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 141138. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","textile","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/96fff19e-4f44-44da-b84d-8d98edabe144.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '590 hour'),
  ('973fa4b2-f429-4139-a426-b46b8017d9a5', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'French Association for the Advancement of Science', 'Louis Oscar Roty — Art Institute of Chicago, object 143879. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","animal","figure study","botanical","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/973fa4b2-f429-4139-a426-b46b8017d9a5.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '591 hour'),
  ('97517851-f01b-4e30-b0da-943f848bedc6', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Winged Victory of Samothrace (Victoire de Samothrace)', 'Unknown — Art Institute of Chicago, object 212217. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/97517851-f01b-4e30-b0da-943f848bedc6.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '592 hour'),
  ('9775b915-cc07-4f49-b1fa-e3d7bee27083', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'A Poem from the Shin Kokinshu with Design of Shinobugusa (Moss Fern)', 'Kôetsu — Art Institute of Chicago, object 228951. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/9775b915-cc07-4f49-b1fa-e3d7bee27083.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '593 hour'),
  ('97d5b8ac-ad0c-4053-8a0d-3cdc27678a09', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Punch Bowl, Queen''s Cañon, Glen Eyrie, from the series "Gurnsey''s Rocky Mountain Views"', 'B. H. Gurnsey — Art Institute of Chicago, object 103146. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/97d5b8ac-ad0c-4053-8a0d-3cdc27678a09.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '594 hour'),
  ('98218a88-d425-408a-bf61-5d30d0b6cd65', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Beaker in the Form of a Seated Female with Tatoos and Body Paint', 'Nasca — Art Institute of Chicago, object 91274. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/98218a88-d425-408a-bf61-5d30d0b6cd65.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '595 hour'),
  ('98325502-4032-4654-8071-a1aa55aab3b2', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Prince Otto von Bismarck', 'I aimed to let the figure rise slowly from the dark, with the face held in a hard, quiet light. The brushwork is spare and direct, leaving the coat and background as dense, shadowed masses so that the sitter’s presence feels both immediate and inward. I was interested less in decoration than in the weight of a life carried through silence.

Franz Seraph von Lenbach — Art Institute of Chicago, object 4896. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","portrait","monochrome","figurative","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/98325502-4032-4654-8071-a1aa55aab3b2.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '596 hour'),
