  ('a389b964-8a1d-4102-b523-01963abf52ff', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Panel from an Altar Frontal', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 94560. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/a389b964-8a1d-4102-b523-01963abf52ff.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '645 hour'),
  ('a3924f75-6c05-461d-afc8-c06c9bae29b1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Lady Erskine', 'I have treated the oval frame as a private theatrical space, gathering a seated figure, rich drapery, and a distant landscape into one intimate relief. The raised surfaces preserve the pressure of the hand, while the softened contours and ornamental folds open a space between portraiture and invention.

