  ('a7231c3f-569e-4888-9f35-4207502f017c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Saint Martin', 'French — Art Institute of Chicago, object 28455. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/a7231c3f-569e-4888-9f35-4207502f017c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '663 hour'),
  ('a75345e3-1769-4fdc-9d1f-8431bc2304c3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Woman Looking For Fleas', 'Giuseppe Maria Crespi — Art Institute of Chicago, object 59858. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","interior","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/a75345e3-1769-4fdc-9d1f-8431bc2304c3.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '664 hour'),
  ('a75f57dd-7855-4898-b3b8-20ee5aaa0eb3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Covered Vase', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 259168. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/a75f57dd-7855-4898-b3b8-20ee5aaa0eb3.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '665 hour'),
  ('a76f68c6-32e3-4dd6-9d94-c79a741c76a4', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Pole Screen', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 27557. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/a76f68c6-32e3-4dd6-9d94-c79a741c76a4.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '666 hour'),
  ('a81ab3ef-2f83-465a-bfc5-cdaf7ee4f3a6', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Robe', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 200042. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/a81ab3ef-2f83-465a-bfc5-cdaf7ee4f3a6.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '667 hour'),
  ('a881eb25-d925-4348-bae8-1e52c4764084', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Ornament With Flower and Eight Wild Folk', 'I conceived this piece as a dense, animated ornament in which the human body, foliage, scrollwork, and inscriptions are made to strain, curl, and support one another in perpetual motion. The figures seem less like separate characters than living parts of a single ornamental architecture, balancing wit, strain, and theatrical energy. I wanted the composition to feel both orderly in its symmetry and unruly in its details, with every ribbon, tendril, and limb contributing to a charged, almost breathing surface.

Israhel van Meckenem, the younger — Art Institute of Chicago, object 3818. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated","figurative","illustrative","energetic","playful","dramatic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/a881eb25-d925-4348-bae8-1e52c4764084.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '668 hour'),
  ('a8c35afd-1ecc-48d7-a07a-756ac9c7554f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Lieutenant General Sir Colin Campbell, G.C.B.', 'Roger Fenton — Art Institute of Chicago, object 92978. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/a8c35afd-1ecc-48d7-a07a-756ac9c7554f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '669 hour'),
  ('a8f387ca-7712-4a13-a41d-ec32faaf97d7', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Junius Brutus Booth', 'I wanted the sitter’s presence to feel immediate but not theatrical: a face held between illumination and shadow, rendered with enough looseness that the flesh seems to emerge from the ground rather than merely rest upon it. The dark, fur-trimmed costume and the subdued surround give the portrait its gravity, while the restrained warmth of the skin and the unsmiling gaze keep the figure human, self-contained, and quietly formidable.

Robert Matthew Sully — Art Institute of Chicago, object 8528. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","dramatic","contemplative","realism"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/a8f387ca-7712-4a13-a41d-ec32faaf97d7.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '670 hour'),
  ('a9155171-e2b6-4410-b15f-df23361c4519', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Kingfisher and iris', 'Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 26027. Public domain (CC0).', '{"vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/a9155171-e2b6-4410-b15f-df23361c4519.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '671 hour'),
  ('a9ff1aa5-fc33-4741-9eb5-6620cdea339b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Domenico da Gambassi', 'Andrea del Sarto — Art Institute of Chicago, object 154037. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","portrait","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/a9ff1aa5-fc33-4741-9eb5-6620cdea339b.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '672 hour'),
  ('aa2a5281-3eea-4f67-bf4c-99978ceb3adc', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Ôhi (Stole)', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 150764. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/aa2a5281-3eea-4f67-bf4c-99978ceb3adc.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '673 hour'),
  ('aa300e41-ca08-4321-8a04-4eb5fbe6f080', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Tampan (Ceremonial Cloth)', 'Paminggir — Art Institute of Chicago, object 150705. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/aa300e41-ca08-4321-8a04-4eb5fbe6f080.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '674 hour'),
  ('aab15e33-973d-46d3-9d01-5a9642a6e3cc', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Fall of the Giants', 'In this work I press the body into a collapsing landscape, letting gesture and pressure carry the drama: limbs reach, fall, and interlock among fractured stone until the figures become part of the same violent motion. The monochrome line keeps the event elemental, reducing it to the urgent rhythm of struggle, weight, and release.

Salvator Rosa — Art Institute of Chicago, object 16. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","vivid","figurative","dramatic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/aab15e33-973d-46d3-9d01-5a9642a6e3cc.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '675 hour'),
  ('ab425c2b-62b4-40ac-9c47-162e32192a1e', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Double Spout and Bridge Vessel in the Form of a Ridged Gourd', 'I was drawn to the vessel’s rounded, resting body and the simple lift of its arched handle, a form that feels at once practical and ceremonial. The pale surface is left open and porous, with small warm traces of firing allowed to remain visible rather than corrected.

Paracas — Art Institute of Chicago, object 3579. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome","minimalist","abstract","geometric","serene","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/ab425c2b-62b4-40ac-9c47-162e32192a1e.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '676 hour'),
  ('abc05d62-3736-4a5b-9fc9-d20664123a69', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Rebecca Salsbury Strand', 'Alfred Stieglitz — Art Institute of Chicago, object 66269. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/abc05d62-3736-4a5b-9fc9-d20664123a69.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '677 hour'),
  ('ac04fdd0-3ba9-4ee0-a444-36d324f3de82', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Neopolitan', 'I sought to catch the inward life of the sitter, allowing shadow to gather around her face like a second presence. The veil, the pale highlight, and the quiet turn of the gaze become the true subject: a brief encounter with thought, memory, and vulnerability.

Julia Margaret Cameron — Art Institute of Chicago, object 14325. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","portrait","muted","figurative","realism","contemplative","dramatic","melancholic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/ac04fdd0-3ba9-4ee0-a444-36d324f3de82.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '678 hour'),
  ('ac548074-d57e-470a-82c4-2281b1788b01', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Torso of a Nude Man', 'I set a broken torso upright, giving the fragment a fragile monumentality; the rough surfaces and simplified planes hold both the memory of a body and the fact of its loss. The figure rises from its dark base as if from an archaeological silence, inviting attention to gesture, weight, and the quiet drama of what remains.

Ancient Greek — Art Institute of Chicago, object 326. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","sculpture","figure study","monochrome","figurative","gestural","solemn","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/ac548074-d57e-470a-82c4-2281b1788b01.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '679 hour'),
  ('acfd5dca-08bc-4fe0-9b08-ebd77c658f67', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Resting Bacchante', 'Johann August Nahl, II — Art Institute of Chicago, object 90816. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/acfd5dca-08bc-4fe0-9b08-ebd77c658f67.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '680 hour'),
  ('ad102147-d22f-4824-b77d-b40b09d05c8e', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Faceted and Covered Jar', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/ad102147-d22f-4824-b77d-b40b09d05c8e.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '681 hour'),
  ('ad929c29-1536-46ae-ad0e-f956fd460dc1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Gaspar Charrier, King''s Secretary', 'I set the sitter within an oval frame, letting the engraved line build the curl of the hair, the breadth of the collar, and the weight of the dark fabric into a likeness of measured dignity. The inscription, laurel, and coat of arms gather rank and remembrance around the face, while the quiet turn of the eyes gives the portrait a restrained inward life.

Antoine Masson — Art Institute of Chicago, object 116. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated","energetic","realism","figurative","solemn","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/ad929c29-1536-46ae-ad0e-f956fd460dc1.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '682 hour'),
  ('ada468e8-014a-4042-9fef-4833d0710df3', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Statuette of Hercules', 'Ancient Roman — Art Institute of Chicago, object 52764. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/ada468e8-014a-4042-9fef-4833d0710df3.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '683 hour'),
  ('ae135ace-8fa3-41f5-a15f-c6e15d4323ce', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Landscape in the Style of Ancient Masters: after Wang Meng (c. 1308-1385)', 'Lan Ying — Art Institute of Chicago, object 204584. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ink","muted","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/ae135ace-8fa3-41f5-a15f-c6e15d4323ce.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '684 hour'),
  ('ae6882ae-f3e9-4719-8c21-fbfa47f65a84', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Shinobazu Pond at Ueno (Ueno Shinobazu no ike), from the series "Famous Places in Edo (Koto meisho)"', 'I composed the scene as an evening excursion along the shore of Ueno Pond, where bare trees, passing pedestrians, and distant buildings settle into a quiet rhythm against the water. The flattened perspective and decorative color keep the view intimate and atmospheric, with the warm horizon and deep blue lake giving the season a restrained, contemplative stillness.

Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25468. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated","figurative","serene","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/ae6882ae-f3e9-4719-8c21-fbfa47f65a84.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '685 hour'),
  ('aeb8e457-12e1-40c1-b0cb-bb9f9e8ef8cf', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Kintai Bridge in Suo Province (Suo no kuni Kintaibashi), from the series "Unusual Views of Famous Bridges in Various…', 'Katsushika Hokusai — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25175. Public domain (CC0).', '{"muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/aeb8e457-12e1-40c1-b0cb-bb9f9e8ef8cf.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '686 hour'),
  ('af2c0db9-63c2-4e21-96e0-6b2d2d14706c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'James Milliken Jr.', 'Jean Etienne Liotard — Art Institute of Chicago, object 269794. Public domain (CC0).', '{"pastel","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/af2c0db9-63c2-4e21-96e0-6b2d2d14706c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '687 hour'),
  ('afd1ed46-2076-489a-8f1b-6737c3233782', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'St. Joseph and Christ Child', 'Leopold Kupelwieser — Art Institute of Chicago, object 99652. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","architecture","floral","food","landscape","botanical","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/afd1ed46-2076-489a-8f1b-6737c3233782.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '688 hour'),
  ('affe2701-f4b5-4289-927d-545d9c9c6a83', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Boy''s Baijia Pao ("One Hundred Household" Robe)', 'Han-Chinese — Art Institute of Chicago, object 150152. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/affe2701-f4b5-4289-927d-545d9c9c6a83.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '689 hour'),
  ('b055c350-5632-478e-8f3f-9b1320cca313', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Adoration of the Magi', 'I use line as the chief instrument of light and devotion, shaping faces, drapery, and architecture through incised rhythm. The foreground adoration is held in solemn attention, while the distant procession and animals keep the earthly world moving around the sacred stillness.

Israhel van Meckenem, the younger — Art Institute of Chicago, object 3714. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated","energetic","figurative","solemn","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b055c350-5632-478e-8f3f-9b1320cca313.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '690 hour'),
  ('b06087f2-b7b6-4725-8228-3c11d693a5c8', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Flowers of All Seasons', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 198916. Public domain (CC0).', '{"muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b06087f2-b7b6-4725-8228-3c11d693a5c8.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '691 hour'),
  ('b082ba02-a025-4c1d-969b-fad682ad2adf', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Achira Root Vessel', 'Nasca — Art Institute of Chicago, object 91361. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","landscape","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b082ba02-a025-4c1d-969b-fad682ad2adf.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '692 hour'),
  ('b0bb688e-5904-4219-a7e7-76d7100afbc9', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Untitled', 'The piece presents a candid, human-scale street encounter, grounded in the everyday textures of an older urban neighborhood. Its tonal restraint and observed gestures keep the moment close to documentary realism, while the clustered figures and uneven rhythms of the scene introduce a quiet narrative tension. The composition balances informality with a measured visual architecture, allowing the photograph to feel both immediate and quietly enduring.

Lewis Wickes Hine — Art Institute of Chicago, object 11335. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","monochrome","realism","street art","dramatic","tense","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b0bb688e-5904-4219-a7e7-76d7100afbc9.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '693 hour'),
