  ('b1eea2d5-c3ef-4e01-939f-237dcafbb73c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'I Will Tell the White Man', 'Frederic Remington — Art Institute of Chicago, object 97891. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b1eea2d5-c3ef-4e01-939f-237dcafbb73c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '696 hour'),
  ('b24d4178-17d8-42df-9d40-40fb017fffb2', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Calligraphy Accompanying Xugu''s Painting', 'Xugu — Art Institute of Chicago, object 217672. Public domain (CC0).', '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b24d4178-17d8-42df-9d40-40fb017fffb2.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '697 hour'),
  ('b268efb0-6c74-4d35-a16b-4e95b0b40423', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Sazai Hall at the Temple of the Five Hundred Arhats (Gohyaku rakan Sazaido), from the series "Famous Places in the…', 'I composed the scene as a quiet movement through cultivated land, where bent figures, a winding path, trees, and temple roofs share one measured rhythm. The open sky and layered fields draw the eye gently inward, balancing labor, shelter, and nature in a calm seasonal hush.

Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25390. Public domain (CC0).', '{"muted","illustrative","serene","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b268efb0-6c74-4d35-a16b-4e95b0b40423.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '698 hour'),
  ('b2819fa9-5d55-4880-9086-c0b977a2471d', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Goyu, from the series "Fifty-three Stations of the Tokaido (Tokaido gojusan tsugi)"', 'Travelers and porters pass through the Oil Post Town along the Tōkaidō, their bundled loads and traveling staffs giving the scene its immediate life. A river, distant hills, and the broad bands of cloud above open the composition out beyond the figures, while the stone marker and roadside forms anchor it in a recognizable place. The work feels vivid and lively, with a quiet narrative energy rather than a solemn or dramatic one.

Katsushika Hokusai — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2981. Public domain (CC0).', '{"vivid","illustrative","energetic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b2819fa9-5d55-4880-9086-c0b977a2471d.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '699 hour'),
  ('b2d7d81a-109c-4de5-9493-dc4a588781dc', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Plate Six from Misery', 'Charles Rambert — Art Institute of Chicago, object 207052. Public domain (CC0).', '{"lithograph","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b2d7d81a-109c-4de5-9493-dc4a588781dc.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '700 hour'),
