  ('b52715e1-bce6-4354-8488-d56c963ba3ea', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Tombeau de Cidi-Abdellah-el-Marabout, Haute-Egypte, plate 62 from the album "Egypte, Nubie, Palestine et Syrie" (1852)', 'Maxime Du Camp — Art Institute of Chicago, object 144274. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b52715e1-bce6-4354-8488-d56c963ba3ea.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '710 hour'),
  ('b56d31b3-5e95-4faf-aa78-9ac63c903305', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Offering Table Containing the Seals of Suzuki Kiitsu', 'Suzuki Kiitsu — Art Institute of Chicago, object 117577. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ink","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b56d31b3-5e95-4faf-aa78-9ac63c903305.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '711 hour'),
  ('b68bcb86-7e46-4422-b867-9eff3e7f455d', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Sari', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 53161. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b68bcb86-7e46-4422-b867-9eff3e7f455d.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '712 hour'),
  ('b6b24e94-abc3-473f-b03a-dd1f6f8ac3a4', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Polonius and Hamlet, plate 4 from Hamlet', 'Eugène Delacroix — Art Institute of Chicago, object 142575. Public domain (CC0).', '{"lithograph","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b6b24e94-abc3-473f-b03a-dd1f6f8ac3a4.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '713 hour'),
  ('b706b4ad-0ebc-4a21-b92d-c7863474da14', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Versailles, Coin de Parc', 'I framed an old stone figure at the edge of a winter park, letting bare branches and a slumped chair interrupt its ceremonial poise. The soft sepia haze keeps the scene between memory and reportage, with the statue’s stillness weighed against the crooked furniture and the long, quiet shadow of the trees.

Jean-Eugène-Auguste Atget — Art Institute of Chicago, object 18967. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated","realism","nostalgic","contemplative","melancholic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b706b4ad-0ebc-4a21-b92d-c7863474da14.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '714 hour'),
  ('b71f4194-c888-4db4-adf1-a862087693db', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Trees on a cliff above a river', 'Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25972. Public domain (CC0).', '{"muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b71f4194-c888-4db4-adf1-a862087693db.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '715 hour'),
  ('b7eb5827-756d-4657-a4a5-c6e6762c2d5d', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Statue of a Young Satyr Wearing a Theater Mask of Silenus', 'Ancient Roman — Art Institute of Chicago, object 221975. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b7eb5827-756d-4657-a4a5-c6e6762c2d5d.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '716 hour'),
  ('b8860b55-92eb-4c34-9a06-3f2652c4229f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Statuette of Herakles', 'Ancient Etruscan — Art Institute of Chicago, object 72215. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b8860b55-92eb-4c34-9a06-3f2652c4229f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '717 hour'),
  ('b8b71ab8-a958-4a03-b0ad-87f0cd78523a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Vestment (For a First-degree Taoist Priest)', 'I conceived this ceremonial textile as a field of mirrored dragons, phoenixes, clouds, and flowering forms, worked in dense metallic embroidery so that rank and protection seem to shimmer across the surface. Its central axis gives the ornament a ritual architecture, while the borders and hem repeat protective emblems like a visual invocation; the garment is meant to make the body feel crowned, guarded, and charged with ancestral authority.

Han-Chinese — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25244. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome","figurative","solemn","dramatic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b8b71ab8-a958-4a03-b0ad-87f0cd78523a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '718 hour'),
  ('b8bd640a-8b6e-4993-bb0b-587ac69659c0', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Unfinished Sketch of Lady Haden', 'James McNeill Whistler — Art Institute of Chicago, object 50690. Public domain (CC0).', '{"lithograph","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b8bd640a-8b6e-4993-bb0b-587ac69659c0.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '719 hour'),
  ('b8cd4be6-8a39-4deb-9de5-1b4909347943', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Looking East, Down the Valley from the Doorway, No. 19 from the series "Devil''s Lake and Vicinity"', 'Henry Hamilton Bennett — Art Institute of Chicago, object 54766. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b8cd4be6-8a39-4deb-9de5-1b4909347943.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '720 hour'),
  ('b947ee0e-ccf2-47e3-92e5-79aadfebd2a4', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fragment', null, '{}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b947ee0e-ccf2-47e3-92e5-79aadfebd2a4.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '721 hour'),
  ('b98c5df5-736e-4eef-b2dd-af6a6150b454', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Ruins of the Palace of the Caesars, plate 18 from Die Römische Ansichten', 'Joseph Anton Koch — Art Institute of Chicago, object 144374. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b98c5df5-736e-4eef-b2dd-af6a6150b454.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '722 hour'),
  ('b9e2a98f-3116-4e29-99e4-8261054d9326', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Mrs. S. H. C. Miner', 'William Notman — Art Institute of Chicago, object 31710. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","portrait","muted","blue dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b9e2a98f-3116-4e29-99e4-8261054d9326.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '723 hour'),
  ('b9ea1d5a-6079-4bd6-97b0-be59b19f47a8', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Portrait of a Boy', 'I have tried to hold the child’s presence in a quiet inwardness, letting the dark, hushed room gather around him like atmosphere. The pale face and collar rise softly from the brown shadows, while the small dog at his side lends the portrait a note of companionship and fragile stillness. My aim was not so much to record a likeness as to preserve a mood: tender, watchful, and suspended.

Eugène Carrière — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2823. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","portrait","animal","interior","muted","figurative","realism","serene","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/b9ea1d5a-6079-4bd6-97b0-be59b19f47a8.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '724 hour'),
  ('ba002bd6-e471-411c-b318-619fb345e12a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Mise-en-carte (Point-paper)', 'Veret — Art Institute of Chicago, object 148922. Public domain (CC0).', '{"gouache","textile","muted","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/ba002bd6-e471-411c-b318-619fb345e12a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '725 hour'),
  ('ba053b66-ac21-492d-9850-46cfaf3c7579', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', '“- You see, my friend Durand.... there are only two important components of happiness for a man: water and wine... but…', 'Honoré-Victorin Daumier — Art Institute of Chicago, object 141915. Public domain (CC0).', '{"lithograph","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/ba053b66-ac21-492d-9850-46cfaf3c7579.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '726 hour'),
  ('ba789697-ac85-4e45-9c05-0425c0f42ef8', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Aileen Flannery', 'I wanted to hold that strange threshold between play and distress: a small child crouched in the sand, caught between a cry and a game, reaching toward a twig figure with the seriousness of ritual. The soft, worn surface turns an ordinary moment into something tender, uncertain, and quietly theatrical.

Alfred Stieglitz — Art Institute of Chicago, object 20338. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated","realism","nostalgic","playful","tense"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/ba789697-ac85-4e45-9c05-0425c0f42ef8.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '727 hour'),
  ('ba9abd62-630d-43e1-acc9-834d022d5880', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Last Poppies', 'Theodore Roussel — Art Institute of Chicago, object 211051. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/ba9abd62-630d-43e1-acc9-834d022d5880.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '728 hour'),
  ('bac1e41a-6850-4687-8519-2f319499ee45', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Vessel in the Form of a Masked Drummer', 'I made this vessel as a compact, seated presence, turning a drinking vessel into a body with a watchful, almost animal face. The raised handle and spout become part of the figure, so utility and character are fused rather than separate. Its dark surface and restrained modeling give the object a grave, charged stillness.

Moche — Art Institute of Chicago, object 6385. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome","figurative","eerie"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/bac1e41a-6850-4687-8519-2f319499ee45.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '729 hour'),
  ('bb69e9dd-ae22-440e-9fa3-f27be2df725f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Still Life: Melon, Fish Jar', 'Imitator of Vincent van Gogh — Art Institute of Chicago, object 27952. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","still life","food","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/bb69e9dd-ae22-440e-9fa3-f27be2df725f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '730 hour'),
  ('bb7a9af4-8329-4ac4-95a8-470a313e9903', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Saint Martin', 'Italian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 110093. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/bb7a9af4-8329-4ac4-95a8-470a313e9903.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '731 hour'),
  ('bbb45fb0-fd57-4786-826c-60cff8df47cb', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Autumnal Sun Set', 'I have sought to catch the last soft light of an autumn afternoon, letting the fields, trees, birds, and quiet figures share one expansive moment of labour and repose. The falling sun gives the scene its quiet grandeur, drawing the eye across the open country while the darkening trees frame the deepening air.

David Lucas — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2118. Public domain (CC0).', '{"landscape","desaturated","realism","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/bbb45fb0-fd57-4786-826c-60cff8df47cb.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '732 hour'),
  ('bc36db7a-4c64-46ad-8f76-ba3e161f3431', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Figure of a Woman Reading', 'I wanted to preserve the hush of a private moment, a woman absorbed in a letter as if the page has drawn her into another world. The soft folds of white, blue, and orange, the pink accents, and the delicate gilded detail create a graceful, intimate charm, with the figure’s lowered gaze giving the whole work a quiet sense of thought and feeling.

Franz Anton Bustelli — Art Institute of Chicago, object 8248. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","ceramic","vivid","red dominant","figurative","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/bc36db7a-4c64-46ad-8f76-ba3e161f3431.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '733 hour'),
  ('bc8fe8c0-74a3-4439-9932-9161b9f0676e', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fragment', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 94920. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/bc8fe8c0-74a3-4439-9932-9161b9f0676e.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '734 hour'),
  ('bcb886e0-fb43-4de0-9b05-65410b01d874', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Grenier', 'I have arranged a room as a chamber of residue: a chair holds a loosened cloth, bottles and small carved figures keep their vigil in half-light, and broken ladders, drapery, and weathered boards lean into the dark. The objects feel gathered by time rather than placed, their textures and absences making the space intimate, unstable, and quietly haunted.

Hippolyte Bayard — Art Institute of Chicago, object 23811. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","monochrome","realism","dramatic","melancholic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/bcb886e0-fb43-4de0-9b05-65410b01d874.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '735 hour'),
  ('bd3d5c01-f58b-4310-887e-458b4900320d', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Relief Depicting a Calf-Bearer', 'Ancient Egyptian — Art Institute of Chicago, object 28825. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/bd3d5c01-f58b-4310-887e-458b4900320d.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '736 hour'),
  ('bd6b8acd-bc22-49bf-9ef1-94213e561903', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Collar', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 26069. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/bd6b8acd-bc22-49bf-9ef1-94213e561903.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '737 hour'),
