  ('c61a3a53-e9ae-4262-83c9-e669caca8886', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Panel (Dress Fabric)', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 149405. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","botanical","food","floral","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/c61a3a53-e9ae-4262-83c9-e669caca8886.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '771 hour'),
  ('c653d36c-5ae4-42c7-ab0f-ee161633da65', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Portrait of a Man with a Pink', 'I have sought a likeness both immediate and inward: a figure held in quiet attention, his dark cap and somber clothing set against a cool blue ground, while the small flower in his hand lends the portrait a delicate note of transience and private feeling.

Quentin Massys — Art Institute of Chicago, object 864. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","floral","portrait","desaturated","realism","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/c653d36c-5ae4-42c7-ab0f-ee161633da65.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '772 hour'),
  ('c66118f5-89fc-4bb2-bd24-8dd06a23bfd9', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Juglet', 'Bow Porcelain Factory — Art Institute of Chicago, object 40357. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","vivid","blue dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/c66118f5-89fc-4bb2-bd24-8dd06a23bfd9.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '773 hour'),
  ('c69d7b9a-7617-467a-a5fe-7f21eafd09ab', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Rest on the Flight into Egypt', 'I sought to hold a hushed moment of repose: figures gathered beneath leaning trees, their drapery and the soft ground rendered through fine, brown strokes. The wooded setting opens around them, giving the scene a quiet narrative weight, as if rest itself were the true subject.

Bartolomeo Biscaino — Art Institute of Chicago, object 89. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","desaturated","figurative","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/c69d7b9a-7617-467a-a5fe-7f21eafd09ab.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '774 hour'),
