  ('d4caf544-d053-49ce-a867-c0e4f788dc8d', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Rack Picture for Dr. Nones', 'William A. Mitchell — Art Institute of Chicago, object 154496. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","still life","muted","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/d4caf544-d053-49ce-a867-c0e4f788dc8d.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '824 hour'),
  ('d52a8b18-78b7-45bc-9ab9-fa7269f7558d', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Fragment', 'I built a dense, rhythmic field of scrolling stems and stylized blossoms on a deep red ground, letting the warm ochre ornament unfold with measured symmetry and ceremonial grace. The worn edges and softened surface carry the trace of time, while the repeated floral forms retain a calm, ornamental vitality.

