David Dalhoff Neal — Art Institute of Chicago, object 9. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","interior","architecture","muted","realism","solemn","monumental"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/d6b11c9d-f5b4-4b5d-a08b-2d21a6d73797.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '834 hour'),
