  ('d72bf899-bd52-4220-a813-02ac3c73eaba', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Willow Tree at the Gate of Shimabara Pleasure Quarter (Shimabara deguchi no yanagi), from the series “Famous Views…', 'I composed the Kyoto gate as a place of quiet movement, where evening blue gathers above warm roofs and figures pass through the street with the rhythm of ordinary life. The architecture anchors the scene, while small gestures—a carried load, a gathered group, the bright stall—give the moment its human current. I wanted the familiar gate to feel orderly and lived-in, caught between daily labor and a lingering sense of place.

Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25327. Public domain (CC0).', '{"vivid","illustrative","realism","figurative","serene","nostalgic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/d72bf899-bd52-4220-a813-02ac3c73eaba.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '836 hour'),
  ('d7599bc6-3ad1-459b-8bfa-26e5955f245b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Landscape', 'William Keith — Art Institute of Chicago, object 269229. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","landscape","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/d7599bc6-3ad1-459b-8bfa-26e5955f245b.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '837 hour'),
  ('d77e19f0-19ea-4aa5-8caf-b894dcbf7300', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Right Honourable Edward Carey', 'I composed this oval portrait as a quiet study of presence, letting the sitter’s dark coat, red collar, and pale hair rest against the deep green of the curtain and the burnished gold of the frame. The enclosed format gives the figure an intimate, almost ceremonial weight, while the rich fabrics and restrained expression hold a formal dignity within a small, concentrated space.

Samuel Percy — Art Institute of Chicago, object 2305. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","portrait","vivid","realism","solemn"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/d77e19f0-19ea-4aa5-8caf-b894dcbf7300.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '838 hour'),
  ('d78e1eee-3d9f-4d80-a69c-d3bed4b312c2', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Study for the "Madonna of the Rosary"', 'Federico Barocci — Art Institute of Chicago, object 202150. Public domain (CC0).', '{"graphite","gouache"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/d78e1eee-3d9f-4d80-a69c-d3bed4b312c2.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '839 hour'),
