  ('d8f4e4dc-a3d1-4ac7-aa98-51b088b0bfb0', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Model for a Statue of Louis XV', 'Jean-Baptiste Lemoyne II — Art Institute of Chicago, object 46388. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","sculpture","floral","portrait","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/d8f4e4dc-a3d1-4ac7-aa98-51b088b0bfb0.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '843 hour'),
  ('d9456916-6bb3-44bd-beb8-4a2f7955f64e', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Wolf - Apsaroke', 'Edward S. Curtis — Art Institute of Chicago, object 50062. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","portrait","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/d9456916-6bb3-44bd-beb8-4a2f7955f64e.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '844 hour'),
  ('d9de3293-4b88-49d3-95c0-052493cf3e3a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Relief Fragments Depicting a Winged Woman and Two Deer', 'I sought to give breath to a blue, temple-like space in which a lithe dancer moves between two gentle stags, the pale bodies and curling branches held against a deep, quiet ground. The figures are simplified and rhythmic, less concerned with weight than with grace, as if the whole scene were suspended in a ritual of calm attention.

Ancient Roman — Art Institute of Chicago, object 4706. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","animal","muted","blue dominant","figurative","serene","playful"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/d9de3293-4b88-49d3-95c0-052493cf3e3a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '845 hour'),
  ('d9ebc1fa-ef5f-43ff-b6a0-763bfda4155f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Border', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 50315. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/d9ebc1fa-ef5f-43ff-b6a0-763bfda4155f.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '846 hour'),
  ('d9f87efa-d5f4-4517-a5b5-018f557a1487', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Tub', 'Hilaire Germain Edgar Degas — Art Institute of Chicago, object 68369. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","nude","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/d9f87efa-d5f4-4517-a5b5-018f557a1487.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '847 hour'),
  ('daa80ac2-1bc1-45c6-85e5-44f939a6f4fb', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'These Miners Like Their Lunch And A Little Rest In Such Low-Ceilinged Entries', 'I wanted the dark to feel inhabited rather than empty: two miners held in a pause between labor and rest, surrounded by timber, rail, buckets, and the rough body of the earth. The low light reduces the place to endurance—dust, wood, metal, breath—so the mine becomes at once shelter and confinement, a chamber where fatigue and fellowship carry their quiet weight.

Lewis Wickes Hine — Art Institute of Chicago, object 23269. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated","realism","solemn","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/daa80ac2-1bc1-45c6-85e5-44f939a6f4fb.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '848 hour'),
