  ('dddc5cbc-fb22-4e19-89a4-035d01e36370', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Grand Temple de Dendérah (Teutyres), Sculptures de la Façade Postérieure; Haute-Egypte, plate 19 from the album…', 'Maxime Du Camp — Art Institute of Chicago, object 144214. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/dddc5cbc-fb22-4e19-89a4-035d01e36370.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '859 hour'),
  ('de0cb408-700e-4b35-ad3d-b035eaddb57a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Madonna and Child', 'I have made a small devotional relief in which Mary and the Child are drawn into one tender, inward movement, as though the room around them has fallen silent. The softened faces, worn colors, and aged surface are part of the work’s tenderness: not mere age, but the memory of hands, prayers, and time. The little angels behind them hover like breaths of incense, while the dark wooden frame closes around the scene like a private chapel.

After Antonio Rossellino — Art Institute of Chicago, object 16127. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","muted","figurative","serene","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/de0cb408-700e-4b35-ad3d-b035eaddb57a.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '860 hour'),
