  ('e02ec01c-f5f2-4c4a-b508-82e3e244b15f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Symptoms of a Skurry, plate three from The Leicestershire Hunt', 'I have caught the chase at the instant when the hounds have slipped away and the company, half in earnest and half in comic disorder, pours across the Leicestershire fields. Horses strain, riders lean, and the little theatre of red coats, dark coats, fences, and distant hounds turns a country pursuit into a lively study of movement, temperament, and rural energy.

