  ('e4bb7eae-3830-4457-827e-72a93b62836e', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Confidences in the Garden', 'James McNeill Whistler — Art Institute of Chicago, object 50616. Public domain (CC0).', '{"lithograph","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e4bb7eae-3830-4457-827e-72a93b62836e.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '891 hour'),
  ('e4c9b948-6ac2-4c80-8681-8cde0f1aea09', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Richard Morris Hunt', 'Karl Theodore Francis Bitter — Art Institute of Chicago, object 239717. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e4c9b948-6ac2-4c80-8681-8cde0f1aea09.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '892 hour'),
  ('e4d1a3c3-c65b-45f2-af75-18513fc8e98d', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Woman Reading', 'I wanted the figure to seem absorbed rather than posed, held between the private hush of reading and the restless life of the garden beyond. The black hat and dark dress anchor the composition, while the pale lace and newspaper catch the light in broken, immediate touches. I aimed for a portrait that feels intimate and fleeting, caught in a moment of thought.

Édouard Manet — Art Institute of Chicago, object 14591. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","portrait","desaturated","impressionist","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e4d1a3c3-c65b-45f2-af75-18513fc8e98d.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '893 hour'),
  ('e4f0b26f-2770-4599-bd3c-caa4de4f1d4c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Heirloom Textile', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 220754. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e4f0b26f-2770-4599-bd3c-caa4de4f1d4c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '894 hour'),
  ('e503ad6e-0cb9-4564-811b-57485233752c', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Design for a Textile or Wallpaper', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 153144. Public domain (CC0).', '{"graphite","textile","vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e503ad6e-0cb9-4564-811b-57485233752c.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '895 hour'),
  ('e51206d8-c306-4524-99ec-e313cef85d22', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Vase', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 216923. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e51206d8-c306-4524-99ec-e313cef85d22.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '896 hour'),
  ('e536d214-5d96-4edb-9788-6d2ecf41c100', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Altar Frontal', 'I built this textile as a dark ground filled with a continuous, light-filled lattice of scrolling vines and blossoms, gathered around a central urn that gives the whole field its quiet axis. The surface moves between ornament and emblem, using repetition and symmetry to turn floral growth into a ceremonial pattern. Its restrained palette lets the pale forms emerge with a soft luminosity, making the piece feel at once decorative, contemplative, and still.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25104. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome","folk art","serene","solemn","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e536d214-5d96-4edb-9788-6d2ecf41c100.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '897 hour'),
  ('e5454e7d-9b23-44b6-877e-759c749443ee', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Left Leg Broken at Mid-Thigh', 'I shaped this fragment with the body reduced to weight, pressure, and absence: a leg and foot still carrying the suggestion of movement, yet broken, porous, and weathered. The pale ceramic surface is left exposed, with cracks and traces of handling allowed to remain, while the dark base anchors the figure and emphasizes its fragility.

Ancient Greek — Art Institute of Chicago, object 338. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","sculpture","desaturated","figurative","solemn","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e5454e7d-9b23-44b6-877e-759c749443ee.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '898 hour'),
  ('e57a2239-4c2c-4f7c-a2a8-b9f3646e4d38', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Portrait Bust of Police Commissioner of Public Hygiene', 'Louis Oscar Roty — Art Institute of Chicago, object 143695. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","figure study","architecture","botanical","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e57a2239-4c2c-4f7c-a2a8-b9f3646e4d38.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '899 hour'),
