  ('e64517ee-7b0f-4929-bcc8-b38e27b01a82', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Edge of Woods, No. 10 from the portfolio "American Pictorial Photography, Series II” (1901); edition 34/150', 'Clarence H. White — Art Institute of Chicago, object 103538. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e64517ee-7b0f-4929-bcc8-b38e27b01a82.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '906 hour'),
  ('e6c9e340-f0fa-4560-9caa-d0c05b2b879b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Tsuchiyama: Spring Shower (Tsuchiyama, haru no ame), from the series "Fifty-three Stations of the Tokaido (Tokaido…', 'Rain falls in long, driving lines across the bridge, hardening the scene into a rhythm of bent figures, dark trunks, and rushing water. I wanted the journey itself to feel exposed—body and spirit alike—caught between shelter and passage, with Mount Fuji held beyond the weather as a silent presence.

Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25772. Public domain (CC0).', '{"muted","blue dominant","illustrative","tense","dramatic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e6c9e340-f0fa-4560-9caa-d0c05b2b879b.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '907 hour'),
  ('e725eb24-b780-4598-b3f1-430cca41fbb5', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Beaker in the Form of a Trophy Head with Bound Lips', 'Nasca — Art Institute of Chicago, object 91236. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","vivid","red dominant"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e725eb24-b780-4598-b3f1-430cca41fbb5.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '908 hour'),
  ('e778f265-ccf3-4a38-93cb-1e4d52b14245', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Kesa', 'I conceive the dragon as a moving weather-system, body and cloud braided into one continuous pressure of gold, jade, and shadow. The dark ground holds the creature close, so its limbs, horns, and breath seem to gather beneath the surface rather than simply lie upon it; every panel becomes a tide of imperial force, ritual order, and restless life.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 793. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","vivid","figurative","solemn","dramatic"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e778f265-ccf3-4a38-93cb-1e4d52b14245.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '909 hour'),
  ('e7917c13-f34a-4edb-8066-b50a6ae4ceff', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Corbel with Animal Mask with Teeth Fastened on Human Leg from the Monastery Church of Notre-Dame-de-la-Grande-Sauve', 'French — Art Institute of Chicago, object 219298. Public domain (CC0).', '{"sculpture","animal","architecture","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e7917c13-f34a-4edb-8066-b50a6ae4ceff.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '910 hour'),
  ('e7b5dc62-8e10-4f3d-a47b-14f4f9cfcae9', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Single Spout and Bridge Vessel Depicting Dancing Figures', 'Tiwanaku — Art Institute of Chicago, object 91447. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome","black and white"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e7b5dc62-8e10-4f3d-a47b-14f4f9cfcae9.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '911 hour'),
  ('e7e72457-9b66-471a-b383-952b9a211ddd', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Shawl Fragment', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 56136. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e7e72457-9b66-471a-b383-952b9a211ddd.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '912 hour'),
  ('e846fd3a-e4be-4a38-b419-a8a30b649e79', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Christ and the Woman of Samaria, plate 71 from Liber Studiorum', 'Joseph Mallord William Turner — Art Institute of Chicago, object 50209. Public domain (CC0).', '{"etching","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e846fd3a-e4be-4a38-b419-a8a30b649e79.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '913 hour'),
  ('e8bab107-2cb9-4c66-9056-bf8ba84c4d89', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Kuwana: The Landing of the Shichiri Ferry Crossing (Kuwana, Shichiri watashiguchi), from the series "Fifty-three…', 'I wanted the sea road to feel alive with air, salt, and motion, carrying the eye from the pale horizon to the dark sails and the restless wave. The boats, the clustered houses, and the rocky shore become a small world of passage, where the traveler’s journey feels both ordinary and vast.

Utagawa Hiroshige — Art Institute of Chicago, object 25751. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated","illustrative","serene","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/e8bab107-2cb9-4c66-9056-bf8ba84c4d89.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '914 hour'),
