  ('f1004870-b8e3-4c9d-b880-ee05e1a98782', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Head of a Man', 'A small dark head, rounded and inward-turned, carries a quiet, watchful presence; the incised surface gathers the face like a woven covering, while the plain pedestal gives the figure a still, ceremonial weight.

Ancient Greek — Art Institute of Chicago, object 360. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","sculpture","monochrome","figurative","folk art","contemplative","eerie"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f1004870-b8e3-4c9d-b880-ee05e1a98782.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '949 hour'),
  ('f17c3b23-5bbd-4c46-8039-ae4b11ae3951', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Enameled bottle vase', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 41926. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f17c3b23-5bbd-4c46-8039-ae4b11ae3951.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '950 hour'),
  ('f2455a7f-9c5e-475e-b959-692d1d834b98', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Henri-Victor de Rochefort-Luçay', 'Pietro Melandri — Art Institute of Chicago, object 143179. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f2455a7f-9c5e-475e-b959-692d1d834b98.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '951 hour'),
  ('f2594eb8-2502-41c7-8d8a-6868188b8613', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Sacrifice of Polyxena', 'In this composition, figures cluster around a central body in a charged, shadowed space, their gestures and gazes forming a dense emotional architecture. I have treated the scene with broad, expressive handling, allowing light and darkness to carry much of the drama. The figures are rendered with a loose, immediate vitality rather than polished finish, emphasizing feeling, movement, and the solemn intensity of the moment.

Giulio Carpioni — Art Institute of Chicago, object 11022. Public domain (CC0).', '{"oil painting","figure study","monochrome","expressionist","figurative","dramatic","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f2594eb8-2502-41c7-8d8a-6868188b8613.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '952 hour'),
  ('f287a87c-8a78-4171-ba33-34b40d31e3c4', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Navajo Brave and his Mother. The Navajo were formerly a warlike tribe until subdued by U.S. Troops, in 1859-60. Many…', 'Timothy O''Sullivan — Art Institute of Chicago, object 210783. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f287a87c-8a78-4171-ba33-34b40d31e3c4.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '953 hour'),
  ('f2e5ac3c-e211-4971-aa7f-3f2f01334f77', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Four Servants, part of Telemachus Leading Theoclymenus to Penelope from The Story of Odysseus', 'This tapestry presents a ceremonial interior in which figures gather around a table, their draped forms and measured gestures giving the scene a composed, almost ceremonial gravity. The surrounding architecture, garlands, birds, putti, and dense floral ornament transform the room into an opulent woven frame, balancing narrative intimacy with architectural grandeur. Its restrained palette, softened tonal transitions, and layered decorative richness create an atmosphere that feels both contemplative and ceremonial.

Jan van Leefdael — Art Institute of Chicago, object 462. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","muted","figurative","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f2e5ac3c-e211-4971-aa7f-3f2f01334f77.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '954 hour'),
  ('f30eecc4-654d-478b-90d3-7a564e2d7de9', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Dish with Phoenix and Stylized Flowers', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 37522. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ceramic","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f30eecc4-654d-478b-90d3-7a564e2d7de9.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '955 hour'),
  ('f34a6d21-6530-4722-9243-6cda88a1245e', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Ute Braves, of the Kah-poh-teh band, Northern New Mexico, in "full dress", No. 40 from the series "Geographical…', 'Timothy O''Sullivan — Art Institute of Chicago, object 210794. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","vivid"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f34a6d21-6530-4722-9243-6cda88a1245e.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '956 hour'),
  ('f3671cff-3db8-46aa-b1ef-245e5c22b941', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'One Spigot to a Floor. Old-Time Tenement In New York', 'I frame a child at a basin in a narrow domestic passage, caught in the pause between washing and work. Worn wallpaper, exposed pipe, and uneven threshold gather into a quiet record of household life, where the body becomes both subject and evidence of space. Light falls with restrained gravity, letting texture, gesture, and age carry the emotional weight of the scene.

Lewis Wickes Hine — Art Institute of Chicago, object 23326. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","monochrome","realism","contemplative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f3671cff-3db8-46aa-b1ef-245e5c22b941.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '957 hour'),
  ('f40ef0f9-2639-4525-a18e-d53ef5b85d64', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Kameyama, from the series "Fifty-three Stations of the Tokaido (Tokaido gojusan tsugi)"', 'Travelers pause beneath a waterside shelter as a hostess offers a cup, the scene unfolding with the wit and narrative ease of a familiar stop along the Tōkaidō. The open veranda, rippling water, and willow branches open the composition toward the landscape, while the figures’ varied gestures and expressive faces give the episode its human warmth.

Katsushika Hokusai — Art Institute of Chicago, object 3028. Public domain (CC0).', '{"vivid","figurative","serene","playful"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f40ef0f9-2639-4525-a18e-d53ef5b85d64.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '958 hour'),
