  ('f5b91dc4-fe72-4797-9fd3-2dec8c6f3e44', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'The Railway Yard, Balaklava', 'Roger Fenton — Art Institute of Chicago, object 123400. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f5b91dc4-fe72-4797-9fd3-2dec8c6f3e44.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '962 hour'),
  ('f5c8067b-cefb-4848-9766-afbc6ebfe667', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Zal and Rudaba in a Palace, page from a copy of the Shahnama of Firdausi', 'Islamic — Art Institute of Chicago, object 51811. Public domain (CC0).', '{"ink","watercolour","muted"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f5c8067b-cefb-4848-9766-afbc6ebfe667.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '963 hour'),
  ('f5e8e8dc-bd6a-4f39-bee3-04c55952cc13', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Panel', 'I built this long green textile around a quiet rhythm of blossoms, stems, and looping ribbons, letting pale flowers and muted coral accents rise from a softly striated ground. The surface feels woven and alive, delicate without becoming fragile, its floral language carried by a slow, sinuous movement.

Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 1968. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","muted","red dominant","art nouveau","serene"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f5e8e8dc-bd6a-4f39-bee3-04c55952cc13.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '964 hour'),
  ('f5f64a74-e73b-47a7-8b0a-7393a27a509b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Kain Sarong (Skirt)', 'Unknown artist — Art Institute of Chicago, object 28572. Public domain (CC0).', '{"textile","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f5f64a74-e73b-47a7-8b0a-7393a27a509b.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '965 hour'),
  ('f60072f9-b0c0-4869-b97b-aa6199feffe1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Mrs. Craik', 'Unknown — Art Institute of Chicago, object 34958. Public domain (CC0).', '{"photography","desaturated"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f60072f9-b0c0-4869-b97b-aa6199feffe1.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '966 hour'),
  ('f62ff741-360b-4c99-9a0e-6136cc8b201b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Christ at Emmaus, from The Passion', 'I sought to make the moment of recognition at the table arise through the discipline of line: faces, hands, vessels, and folded cloth are weighed against one another, while arches and distant towers frame the sacred encounter without overwhelming its inward gravity. The meal becomes a quiet threshold, where gesture and gaze disclose the presence of Christ among the pilgrims.

Israhel van Meckenem, the younger — Art Institute of Chicago, object 3744. Public domain (CC0).', '{"desaturated","contemplative","realism","dramatic","solemn","figurative"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f62ff741-360b-4c99-9a0e-6136cc8b201b.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '967 hour'),
