  ('f9991e6a-d404-442c-b3bd-3fc3cde754d7', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Hamlet and Laertes in Ophelia''s Grave, plate 15 from Hamlet', 'Eugène Delacroix — Art Institute of Chicago, object 142587. Public domain (CC0).', '{"lithograph","monochrome"}', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/f9991e6a-d404-442c-b3bd-3fc3cde754d7.jpg', timestamptz '2026-01-01 00:00:00+00' + interval '979 hour'),
  ('f9f9a2c0-365a-47b5-900e-92d666e8a3c6', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Rue Royale et Restes des Barricades de 1848', 'I have framed a broad Parisian thoroughfare in the aftermath of unrest, where barricades and rubble interrupt the disciplined façades of the city. The quiet street, the distant dome, and the pale sky give the scene a solemn historical weight, caught between civic order and the memory of struggle.

