  ('fb1a2b0f-5ca2-4344-86d3-f83fe42a8665', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Noli Me Tangere', 'I have set the risen Christ before Mary Magdalene in a quiet rocky landscape, where earthly grief meets divine presence in a moment of restrained recognition. The figures are arranged with deliberate stillness, their gestures opening a space of contemplation rather than spectacle, and the tomb behind them becomes both a literal place and a threshold of grace.

