  ('ffaeb57f-c828-4f70-ade7-39d4cc4d465f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Snow at Akabane Bridge in Shiba (Shiba Akabane no yuki), from the series "Famous Places in the Eastern Capital (Toto…', 'I present Akabane in winter as a quiet passage of snow through the city, where the dark water carries the eye past bridges, tiled roofs, lanterns, and travelers wrapped against the cold. The scene balances the stillness of snow-laden roofs and trees with the small movements of daily life, giving the wintry hour both calm and human warmth.

